<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">1Chanrelnak</book>
  <para style="h">1Chanrelnak</para>
  <para style="toc1">1Chanrelnak</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Chanrelnak</para>
  <para style="mt">1Chanrelnak</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adam, Seth, Enosh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kenan, Mahalalel Jared,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Enok, Methuselah, Lamek,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Noah, Shem, Ham le Jafeth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jafeth fapa hna: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshek le Tiras.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer fapa hna: Ashkenaz, Rifath, le Togarmah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Javan fapa hna: Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim le Rodanim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ham fapa hna: Kush, Izipt, Put le Kanaan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kush fapa hna: Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah, le Sabteka. Raamah fapa hna: Sheba le Dedan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kush cu Nimrod pa kha a si; amah cu vawlei cungah miṭhawng si hram aa thawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izipt cu Lud, Anam, Lehab, Naftuh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathrus, Kasluh (Filistin mi chuahkehnak) le Kaftor mi hna pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kanaan cu a hrin hmasa bik Sidon le Heth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />le Jebus mi hna le Amor mi hna le Girgash mi hna le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiv mi hna le Arki mi hna le Sin mi hna le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Arvad mi hna le Zemari mi hna le Hamath mi hna pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Shem fapa hna: Elam, Asshur, Arpakshad, Lud, Aram, Uz, Hul, Gether le Meshek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arpakshad cu Shelah pa a si i Shelah cu Eber pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eber nih cun fapa pahnih a hrin hna: pakhat min cu Peleg a si (zeitintiah amah chan ah vawleicung mi kha an i ṭhen), cun a unau min cu Joktan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joktan cu Almodad, Shelef, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ebal, Abimael, Sheba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ofir, Havilah le Jobab pa a si, mah hna vialte hi Joktan fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shem in Abraham tiang: Shem, Arpakshad, Shelah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Eber, Peleg, Re-u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Serug, Nahor, Terah le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abram (mah cucu Abraham a si).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abraham fapa hna: Isak le Ishmael.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mah hihi an ciruang an si: Ishmael fater cu Nebaioth; cun Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jetur, Nafish le Kedemah. Mah hna hi Ishmael fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Abraham nuchun Keturah fapa hna: amah nih cun Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak le Shuah a hrin hna. Jokshan fapa hna: Sheba le Dedan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Midian fapa hna: Ephah, Efer, Hanok, Abida le Eldaah. Mah vialte hi Keturah hrinthlak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Abraham cu Isak pa a si. Isak fapa hna cu: Esau le Israel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Esau fapa hna: Elifaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam le Korah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elifaz fapa hna: Teman, Omar, Zefi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna le Amalek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Reuel fapa hna: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah le Mizzah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Seir fapa hna: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer le Dishan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Lotan fapa hna: Hori le Homam; cun Lotan far cu Timna a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Shobal fapa hna: Alian, Manahath, Ebal, Shefi le Onam. Zibeon fapa hna: Aiah le Anah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Anah fapa hna: Dishon. Dishon fapa hna: Hamran, Eshban, Ithran le Kheran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ezer fapa hna: Bilhan, Zaavan le Jaakan. Dishan fapa hna: Uz le Aran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel mi hna cungah siangpahrang ahohmanh an um hlanah mah hna hi Edom ram a rak pengtu siangpahrang cu an si: Beor fapa Bela, amah a khua min cu Dinhabah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Bela a thih tikah, Bozrah khuami Zerah i a fapa Jobab cu amah hmun ah khan a hung bawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jobab cu a thih tikah, Teman mi hna ram mi Husham kha amah hmun ah cun a hung bawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Husham kha a thih tikah, Moab ram chung i Midian mi hna a teitu Bedad i a fapa Hadad kha amah hmun ah cun a hung bawi i a khualipi min cu Avith a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hadad cu a thih tikah, Masrekah mi Samlah kha amah hmun ah cun a hung bawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Samlah cu a thih tikah, Zufrates tiva kam i a ummi Rehoboth khuami Shaul kha amah hmun ah cun bawi a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Shaul cu a thih tikah, Akhbor fapa Baalhanan kha amah hmun ah cun a bawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Baalhanan a thih tikah amah hmun ah khan Hadad cu a hung bawi i a khualipi min cu Pai a si i a nupi min cu Mehetabel a si, amah cu Matred fanu a si, Matred cu Mezahab fanu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Cun Hadad cu a thi. Edom bawi hna cu: Timna bawi, Aliah bawi, Jetheth bawi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Oholibamah bawi, Elah bawi, Pinon bawi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Kenaz bawi, Teman bawi, Mibzar bawi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Magdiel bawi, le Iram bawi an si; mah hna hi Edom bawi cu an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mah hna hi Israel fapa hleihnih cu an si: Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issakhar, Zebulun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan, Josef, Benjamin, Naftali, Gad le Asher.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah fapa panga hna: Er, Onan, le Shelah; mah pathum hna hi Kanaan minu Bathshua nih khan a hrinpiak. Judah fater Er cu Bawipa mithmuh ah miṭhalo a si i a thah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A fapa nupi Tamar zong nih khan Perez le Zerah kha a hrinpiak. Judah nih a dihlak ah fapa panga a ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Perez fapa pahnih hna: Hezron le Hamul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A nau Zerah fapa hna: Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Kalkol, le Dara, an dihlak ah panga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zerah tefa Karmi fapa Akhan kha Israel hna a hnawhtu, pekchanhmi thil a buartu a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cun Ethan fapa cu Azariah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezron nih a hrinmi fapa hna cu: Jerahmeel, Ram le Khelubai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram cu Amminadab pa a si. Amminadab cu Judah fapa hna lak i an bawi Nahshon i a pa kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nahshon cu Salma pa a si, Salma cu Boaz pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Boaz cu Obed pa a si i Obed cu Jesse pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesse cu a fater Eliab le a pahnihnak Abinadab le a pathumnak Shimea le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a palinak Nethanel le a panganak Raddai le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a paruknak Ozem le a pasarihnak David hna pa kha a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />an farle hna cu Zeruiah le Abigail an si. Zeruiah fapa hna cu: Abishai, Joab, le Asahel, pathum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abigail nih Amasa a hrin i Amasa pa cu Ishmael mi Jether a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hezron fapa Kaleb nih a nupi Azubah he Jerioth an hrin; cun mah hna hi a fapa cu an si: Jesher, Shobab le Ardon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azubah cu a thih tikah Kaleb nih cun Efrath kha a ṭhit i amah nih cun Hur kha a hrinpiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hur cu Uri pa kha a si i Uri cu Bezalel pa kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cu hnuah cun Gilead pa Makhir i a fanu kha Hezron nih cun a kawmh i kum sawm ruk a ti ah a ṭhit Segub kha a hrinpiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Segub cu Jair pa a si i Jair cu Gilead ram ah khua kul le thum a ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Geshur le Aram nih Havothjair, Kenath le a khuate hna kha, khua sawm ruk an chuh hna. Mah vialte hna hi Gilead pa Makhir tefa kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hezron thih hnuah, Kaleb nih a pa Hezron nupi Efrathah kha a kawmh i Tekoa pa Ashhur kha a hrinpiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hezron fapa upa bik Jerahmeel fapa hna: a fater Ram, Bunah, Oren, Ozem, le Ahijah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerahmeel nih nupi dang zong a ngei, a min cu Atarah a si; amah cu Onam nu kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerahmeel fapa upa bik Ram fapa hna: Maaz, Jamin le Eker.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Onam fapa hna: Shammai le Jada. Shammai fapa hna: Nadab le Abishur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Abishur nupi min cu Abihail a si; a mah nih Ahban le Molid a hrin hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nadab fapa hna: Seled le Appaim; Seled cu fa ngei loin a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Appaim fapa hna: Ishi. Ishi fapa hna: Sheshan. Sheshan fapa hna: Ahlai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Shammai unau Jada fapa hna: Jether le Jonathan; Jether cu fa ngei loin a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jonathan fapa hna: Peleth le Zaza. Mah hna hi Jerahmeel tefa cu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Sheshan cu fapa a ngei lo, fanu lawng a ngeih hna; asinain Sheshan nih cun Izipt mi sal pakhat a ngei i a min ah Jarha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cucaah Sheshan nih a sal Jarha cu a fanu kha a ṭhitter i Attai kha a hrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Attai cu Nathan pa a si i Nathan cu Zabad pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zabad cu Eflal pa a si i Eflal cu Obed pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Obed cu Jehu pa a si Jehu cu Azariah pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azariah cu Helez pa a si i Helez cu Eleasah pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Eleasah cu Sismai pa a si i Sismai cu Shallum pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Shallum cu Jekamiah pa a si i Jekamiah cu Elishama pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jerahmeel unau Kaleb fapa hna: a hrin hmasa bik Mareshah, amah cu Zif pa a si. Mareshah fapa hna: Hebron.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hebron fapa hna: Korah, Tappuah, Rekem le Shema.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Shema cu Raham pa a si, Raham cu Jorkeam pa a si; cun Rekem cu Shammai pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Shammai fapa cu Maon a si, cun Maon cu Beth-zur pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kaleb nuchun Ephah zong nih Haran, Moza, le Gazez a hrin hna, cun Haran fapa a ngeih i a min Gazez a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Jahdai fapa hna: Regem, Jotham, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, le Shaaf.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Kaleb nuchun Maakah nih, Sheber le Tirhanah a hrin hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Madmannah pa Shaaf le Makbenah le Gibea pa Sheva zong kha a hrin hna. Cun Kaleb fanu cu Akhsah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Mah hna hi Kaleb tefa cu an si: A nupi Efratah he an hrinmi fater cu Hur a si. Hur i a fapa hna cu: Kiriath-jearim pa Shobal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Bethlehem pa Salma, le Beth-gader pa Haref;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim pa Shobal cu Haroeh mi hna le Menuhoth mi hnarcheu hna hringsortu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Cun Kiriath-jearim i a ummi innchungkhar hna cu: Ithra mi, Puth mi, Shumath mi, Misra mi an si; hi hna chung hin Zorah mi le Eshtaol mi kha an chuahkehnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bethlehem tlatu Salma cu Netofah mi, Atroth-beth-joab le Manahath mi le Zor mi hna hringsortu a si; anmah cu Manahath i a ummi innchungkhar pahnih hna lak i pakhat kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />(A tanglei innchungkhar hna hi caṭial le caṭialchin a thiam ngaingaimi an si i Jabez khua ah a ummi an si: Tirath mi, Shimeath mi le Sukath mi an si. Annih hi Ken mi, Rekhab mi he aa ṭhi-ummi kha an si. Rekhab mi hna pa cu Hammath a si.)
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mah hihi David nih Hebron ah a hrinmi a fapa hna cu an si: a fater Amnon cu Jezreel minu Ahinoam nih a hrinpiak; a pahnihnak Daniel cu Karmel minu Abigail nih a hrinpiak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a pathumnak cu Absalom a si, a nu cu Maakah, Geshur siangpahrang Talmai fanu a si; a palinak cu Adonijah a si, a nu cu Haggith a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a panganak cu Shefatiah a si, Abital nih a hrin; a paruknak cu Ithream a si, a nupi Eglah hrinpiakmi a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />kum sarih le thla ruk bawi a cannak Hebron khua ah khan paruk a hrin hna. Cun Jerusalem ah kum sawm thum le kum thum a bawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem i a nupi Bathsheba, Ammiel fanu nih a hrinmi cu mah hna hi an si: Shimea, Shobab, Nathan le Solomon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />cun fapa dang pakua a ngeih hna: Ibhar, Elishua, Elpelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nogah, Nefeg, Jafia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elishama, Eliada le Elifelet an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mah vialte hi David fapa an si, a nupichun fapa hna lengah khan; Tamar cu an far a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomon tefa hna cu: Rehoboam, cu fapa ah Abijah, cu fapa ah Asa, cu fapa ah Jehoshafat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />cu fapa ah Joram, cu fapa ah Ahiziah, cu fapa ah Joash,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />cu fapa ah Amaziah, cu fapa ah Azariah, cu fapa ah Jotham,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cu fapa ah Ahaz, cu fapa ah Hezekiah, cu fapa ah Manasseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />cu fapa ah Amon, cu fapa ah Josiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josiah fapa hna cu: fater Johanan, a pahnihnak Jehoiakim, a pathumnak Zedekiah, a palinak Shallum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoiakim tefa hna cu: a fapa Jekoniah, cu fapa ah Zedekiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />cun ral tlaihmi Jekoniah i fapa hna cu: a fapa Shealtiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Malkhiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hashama, le Nedabiah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pedaiah fapa hna cu: Zerubbabel le Shimei; Zerubbabel fapa hna cu: Meshullam le Hananiah, Shelomith cu an far a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />cun Hashubah, Ohel, Berekhiah, Hasadiah le Jusshabhesed, panga an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hananiah fapa hna: Pelatiah le Jeshaiah, cu fapa ah Refaiah, cu fapa ah Arnan, cu fapa ah Abadiah, cu fapa ah Shekaniah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Shekaniah fapa hna: Shemaiah. Cun Shemaiah fapa hna: Hattush, Igal, Bariah, Neariah, le Shafat, paruk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Neariah fapa hna: Eli-o-enai, Hizkiah, le Azrikam, pathum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eli-o-enai fapa hna: Hodaviah, Eliashib, Pelaiah, Akkub, Johanan, Delaiah, le Anani, pasarih an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah fapa hna: Perez, Hezron, Karmi, Hur le Shobal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Shobal fapa Re-aiah cu Jahath pa a si, Jahath cu Ahumai le Lahad pa a si. Mah hna hi Zorah mi innchungkhar hna cu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mah hna hi Etam fapa cu an si: Jezreel, Ishma, le Idbash; cun an farnu min cu Hazzelelponi a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />cun Penuel cu Gedor pa a si i Ezer cu Hushah pa a si. Bethlehem pa Efrathah i a fater Hur i a fapa hna cu mah hna hi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tekoa pa Ashhur nih nupi pahnih a ngei, Helah le Naarah an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Naarah nih cun Ahuzzam, Hefer, Temeni, le Haahastari a hrinpiak. Mah hna hi Naarah fapa cu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Helah fapa hna: Zereth, Izhar, le Ethnam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Koz cu Anub, Zobebah le Harum fapa Aharhel innchungkhar hna pa kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jabez cu a unau hna nakin upat awk tlak deuh a si; cun a nu nih a min cu, “Har lengmang in ka hrin caah,” tiin Jabez tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabez nih cun Israel Pathian cu a auh i, “Nangmah nih thluachuahnak ka pe law ka ramri kauhter law na kut cu ka sinah um seh law keimah cu harnak nih a ka tlunh nakhnga lo harnak chungin ka huppheng ko sawh,” tiah a ti. Cun Pathian nih a halmi kha a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Shuhah unau Khelub cu Eshton pa Mehir pa kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eshton cu Bethrapa, Paseah le Tehinnah pa a si, Tehinnah cu Ir-nahash pa a si. Mah hna hi Rekah mi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kenaz fapa hna: Othniel le Seraiah; Othniel fapa hna: Hathath le Meonothai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Meonothai cu Ofrah pa a si; cun Seraiah cu Geharashim hna pa Joab pa a si, annih cu zungthiam an si caah Geharashim ti an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jefunneh fapa Kaleb fapa hna: Iru, Elah, le Naam; cun Elah fapa hna: Kenaz.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehallelel fapa hna: Zif, Zifah, Tiria, le Asarel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ezrah fapa hna: Jether, Mered, Efer, le Jalon. Mah hna hi Mered nih a ṭhitmi Faro fanu Bithiah fapa hna cu an si; cun fa a pawi i Miriam, Shammai, le Ishbah a hrin hna, Ishbah cu Eshtemoa pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun a nupi Judah minu nih Gedor pa Jered, Soko pa Heber, le Zanoah pa Jekuthiel a hrin hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Naham far a simi Hodiah nupi fapa hna cu Gar mi Keilah le Maakath mi Eshtemoa pa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Shimon fapa hna: Amnon, Rinnah, Benhanan, le Tilon. Ishi fapa hna: Zoheth le Benzoheth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah fapa Shelah fapa hna cu: Lekah pa Er, le Beth-ashbea i puan hmangṭhia a sertu hna phun innchungkhar hna le Mareshah pa Laadah le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jokim le Kozeba, Joash le Saraf mi, Moab ram i uktu a rak si i Lehem i a kir ṭhanmi hna kha an si (atu cu an rak ṭialmi roca kha a hlun cang).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mah hna hi um sertu le Netaim le Gederah i a ummi hna kha an si; khika ah siangpahrang sinah khan a rianṭuan awkah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simeon fapa hna: Nemuel, Jamin, Jarib, Zerah, Shaul
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Shallum cu a fapa a si, Mibsam cu a fapa a si, Mishma cu a fapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mishma fapa hna: a fapa Hammuel, cu fapa ah Zakkur, cu fapa ah Shimei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Shimei cu fapa hleiruk le fanu paruk a ngei; sihmanhsehlaw a unau hna cu fa tampi an ngei lo, an chungkhar vialte zong Judah mi hna bantukin an karh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Annih cu Beersheba, Moladah, Hazar-shual,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bilhah, Ezem, Tolad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Bethuel, Hormah, Ziklag,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Beth-markaboth, Hazar-susim, Beth-biri, le Shaaraim ah khua an sa. David a hung bawi tiang khan mah hna hi an khua an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cun an khuate hna cu Etam, Ain, Rimmon, Tokhen, le Ashan, khua panga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />le hi khua hna pawngkam i a ummi khuate vialte, Baal tiangin, an si. Mah hna hi an umnak hmun an si i annih nih an chuahkehnak caṭial roca kha an i ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Meshobab, Jamlekh, Amaziah fapa Joshah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Joel, Jehu Joshibiah fapa, Joshibiah cu Seraiah fapa, Seraiah cu Asiel fapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Elioenai, Jaakobah, Jeshohaiah, Asaiah, Adiel, Jesimiel, Benaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Shifi fapa Ziza, Shifi cu Allon fapa, Allon cu Jedaiah fapa, Jedaiah cu Shimri fapa, Shimri cu Shemaiah fapa
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />hi an min in chimmi hna hi an innchungkhar cio ah bawi an si i an pale innchungkhar cio hna cu tampi in an karh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Annih nih Gedor i va luhnak ah khan, nelrawn nichuahlei kamah khan, an saṭil run hna ca i ram hno kawl awkah an kal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />khika ah ram hno ram ṭha kha an va hmuh i hmun zong kha a rak kau ngaingai i a dai i hnangamnak hmun a si; zeitintiah khika i a rak um hmasami hna cu Ham tefa kha an rak si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hi an min in ṭialmi hna hi, Judah siangpahrang Hezekiah chan ah khan an ra i, an thlam hna le khika i khua a rak sami Meunim mi hna kha an hrawh hna i nihin ni tiang hin an hloh cikcek hna i an umnak ah khan anmah an um, zeicahtiah khika ah khan an saṭil run hna caah ram a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cun annih lak i tlawmpal, Simeon mi za nga, hna cu Seir Tlang ah an kal i an hruaitu ah cun Ishi fapa hna Pelatiah, Neariah, Refaiah, le Uzziel kha an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />cun annih nih a luatmi Amalek mi a tang rihmi hna kha an hrawh hna i khika ah nihin ni tiangin khua an sa.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel fater Reuben i fapa hna (amah cu a fater a si, sihmanhsehlaw a pa ihkhun kha a thurhnawmhter caah a fater sinak cu Israel fapa Josef fapa hna sinah khan pek a si, cucaah chanrelnak ah khan a fater sinak ning khan khumh a si lo
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah cu a unau hna lakah a ṭhawngmi a hung si i amah chungin bawi a hung chuak nain, fater sinak tu cu Josef ta a si ko),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel fater Reuben fapa hna: Hanok, Pallu, Hezron, le Karmi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Joel fapa hna: a fapa ah Shemaiah, cu fapa ah Gog, cu fapa ah Shimei,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />cu fapa ah Mikah, cu fapa ah Reaiah, cu fapa ah Baal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />cu fapa ah Beerah, Assiria siangpahrang Tilgath-pilne-ser nih sal ah a kalpimi kha; amah cu Reuben mi lakah an bawi bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun a rualchan hna cu an innchungkhar cio ningin, an chan cio chanrelnak kha ṭial a si tikah hi bangin a si: upa bik Jeiel le Zekhariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />le Azaz fapa Bela an si; Azaz cu Shema fapa, Shema cu Joel fapa a si; annih cu Aroer ah Nebo le Baalmeon tiang khan an rak um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nichuahlei ah Zufrates tiva hi lei kam thetse ram luhnak tiang khan a um fawn, zeicahtiah Gilead ram ah an saṭil kha a karh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Saul chan ah khan Hag mi kha an doh hna i cu hna cu an kut in an va tei hna; cun Gilead in nichuahlei ram dihlak ah khan an thlam chungah cun khua an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gad fapa hna cu annih zawn ah khan Bashan ram chungah khan Salekah tiangin an um:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Joel cu upa bik a si, a pahnihnak ah Shafam, cun Bashan i a ummi Janai le Shafat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun an rualchan hna, anmah le an pale innchungkhar ning cio ah: Mikhael, Meshullam, Sheba, Jorai, Jakan, Zia, le Eber, pasarih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi hna hi Abihail fapa cu an si. Abihail cu Huri fapa, Huri cu Jaroah fapa, Jaroah cu Gilead fapa, Gilead cu Mikhael fapa, Mikhael cu Jeshishai fapa, Jeshishai cu Jahdo fapa, Jahdo cu Buz fapa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Guni fapa Abdiel i fapa Ahi cu an pale innchungkhar hna lakah bawi bik a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />annih cu Gilead le Bashan le a pawngkam khua vialte le Sharon ram chung i saṭil tlonnak hmun dihlak ah khan an ramri tiangin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi hna vialte hi Judah siangpahrang Jotham le Israel siangpahrang Jeroboam chan ah khan an chuahkehnak ning in cazin khumh an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu hna nih khan phaw le nam aa putmi, li kuaih a thiam i ral tuknak ah a thiam ngaingaimi, aa tim ciami minung sang li le thong li le za sarih le sawm ruk an ngeih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Annih nih Hag mi, Jetur mi, Nafish mi le Nodab mi kha an tuk hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />cun annih nih bawmhnak kha an hmuh tikah Hag mi hna le an sir i a ummi vialte hna kha an kut chungah cun pek an si, zeicahtiah raldohnak hmun chungah cun Pathian kha an auh i amah kha an i bochan caah an nawlnak kha a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Annih nih an ṭilva kha an i kalpi hna: an kalauk sang nga, tuu sing hnih le sang nga, laa thong hnih, le a nung in mi thong za khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Raldohnak cu Pathian ta a si caah tampi an thah hna. Cun saltan caan tiang an umnak ah cun khua an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Manasseh phun cheu chung mi hna kha ram chungah cun an um; Bashan in Baal-hermon, Senir, le Hermon Tlang tiang, an tam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hi hna hi an pale innchungkhar cio an lu hna cu an si: Efer, Ishi, Eliel, Azriel, Jeremiah, Hodaviah le Jahdiel, a ṭhawngmi ralkap, min thang, an pale innchungkhar hna lu cio an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw an pupa hna Pathian cungah khan an sual i an hmaiah Pathian nih a hrawhmi hna ram chung i a ummi pathian hna sinah khan hlawh an hlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cucaah Israel Pathian nih khan Assiria siangpahrang Pul thinlung le Assiria siangpahrang Tilgath-pilne-ser thinlung kha a thawhter i amah nih cun Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu hna cu a kalpi hna i Halah, Habor, Hara, le Gozan tiva ah a phakpi hna, i nihin ni tiang hin an um ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levi fapa hna: Gershom, Kohath, le Merari.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kohath fapa hna: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amram fale hna: Aaron, Moses, le Miriam. Aaron fapa hna: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar, le Ithamar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eleazar cu Phinehas pa a si, Phinehas cu Abishua pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abishua cu Bukki pa a si, Bukki cu Uzzi pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzzi cu Zerahiah pa a si, Zerahiah cu Meraioth pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meraioth cu Amariah pa a si, Amariah cu Ahitub pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahitub cu Zadok pa a si, Zadok cu Ahimaaz pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahimaaz cu Azariah pa a si, Azariah cu Johanan pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Johanan cu Azariah pa a si (amah cu Jerusalem i Solomon nih inn a sakmi chung i tlangbawi a ṭuan mi kha a si).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azariah cu Amariah pa a si, Amariah cu Ahitub pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahitub cu Zadok pa a si, Zadok cu Shallum pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Shallum cu Hilkiah pa a si, Hilkiah cu Azariah pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azariah cu Seraiah pa a si, Seraiah cu Jehozadak pa a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar kut in Judah le Jerusalem cu saltannak chungah Bawipa nih a thlak tik hna ah Jehozadak cu saltannak chungah a kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levi fapa hna: Gershom, Kohath, le Merari.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun mah hihi Gershom fapa hna min cu an si: Libni le Shimei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohath fapa hna: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Merari fapa hna: Mahli le Mushi. Mah hna hi Levi mi innchungkhar hna, an pupa hna ning cio ah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gershom fapa hna: a fapa cu Libni a si, cu fapa ah Jahath, cu fapa ah Zimmah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />cu fapa ah Joah, cu fapa ah Iddo, cu fapa ah Zerah, cu fapa ah Jeatherai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kohath fapa hna: a fapa ah Amminadab, cu fapa ah Korah, cu fapa ah Assir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />cu fapa ah Elkanah, cu fapa ah Ebiasaf, cu fapa ah Assir,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />cu fapa ah Tahath, cu fapa ah Uriel, cu fapa ah Uzziah, cu fapa ah Shaul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Elkanah fapa hna: Amasai le Ahimoth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />cu fapa ah Elkanah, cu fapa ah Zofai, cu fapa ah Nahath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />cu fapa ah Eliab, cu fapa ah Jeroham, cu fapa ah Elkanah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Samuel fapa hna: a fater cu Joel a si, a pahnihnak cu Abijah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Merari fapa hna: a fapa ah Mahli, cu fapa ah Libni, cu fapa ah Shimei, cu fapa ah Uzzah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />cu fapa ah Shimea, cu fapa ah Haggiah, cun cu fapa ah Asaiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mah hna hi David nih Bawipa inn chungah, khika i kuang kha chiah a si hnuah, hla saknak rian tlaitu ah a chiahmi hna cu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Solomon nih Bawipa inn kha Jerusalem ah a sak hlantiang, tonnak thlam puan biakinn hmaiah khan hla in rian an ṭuan; an rian cu aa chang lengmang tein an ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi hna hi rian a ṭuanmi hna le an fapa hna cu an si. Kohath mi hna chungin: hla satu Heman, amah cu Joel fapa a si, Joel cu Samuel fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Samuel cu Elkanah fapa a si, Elkanah cu Jeroham fapa a si, Jeroham cu Eliel fapa a si, Eliel cu Toah fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Toah cu Zuf fapa a si, Zuf cu Elkanah fapa a si, Elkanah cu Mahath fapa a si, Mahath cu Amasai fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amasai cu Elkanah fapa a si, Elkanah cu Joel fapa a si, Joel cu Azariah fapa a si, Azariah cu Zefaniah fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Zefaniah cu Tahath fapa a si, Tahath cu Assir fapa a si, Assir cu Ebiasaf fapa a si, Ebiasaf cu Korah fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Korah cu Izhar fapa a si, Izhar cu Kohath fapa a si, Kohath cu Levi fapa a si, Levi cu Israel fapa a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />cun a orhlei kamah a dirmi a unau Asaf, cu Asaf cu Berekhiah fapa a si, Berekhiah cu Shimea fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Shimea cu Mikhael fapa a si, Mikhael cu Baaseiah fapa a si, Baaseiah cu Malkhijah fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Malkhijah cu Ethni fapa a si, Ethni cu Zerah fapa a si, Zerah cu Adaiah fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Adaiah cu Ethan fapa a si, Ethan cu Zimmah fapa a si, Zimmah cu Shimei fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Shimei cu Jahath fapa a si, Jahath cu Gershom fapa a si, Gershom cu Levi fapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Kehlei kamah Merari fapa hna, an unau hna kha an um: Ethan, amah cu Kishi fapa a si, Kishi cu Abdi fapa a si, Abdi cu Malluk fapa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Malluk cu Hashabiah fapa a si, Hashabiah cu Amaziah fapa a si, Amaziah cu Hilkiah fapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hilkiah cu Amzi fapa a si, Amzi cu Bani fapa a si, Bani, cu Shemer fapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Shemer cu Mahli fapa a si, Mahli cu Mushi fapa a si, Mushi cu Merari fapa a si, Merari cu Levi fapa a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />cun an unau hna Levi mi hna cu Pathian inn chung puan biakinn rian vialte kha ṭuan awkah thiah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Aaron le a fapa hna nih khan, Pathian sal Moses nih nawl a rak chiahmi vialte ning khan, a thiang bik hmun rian vialte ca le Israel mi caah remnak ser awkah, khangh thawinak biakṭheng cungah le zihmui biakṭheng cungah pekchanhnak kha an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hi hna hi Aaron fapa cu an si: a fapa ah Eleazar, cu fapa ah Phinehas, cu fapa ah Abishua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />cu fapa ah Bukki, cu fapa ah Uzzi, cu fapa ah Zerahiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />cu fapa ah Meraioth, cu fapa ah Amariah, cu fapa ah Ahitub,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />cu fapa ah Zadok, cu fapa ah Ahimaaz.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Mah hihi an ramri chungah an umnak hmun cio ningin, khua an saknak hmun hna cu an si: Kohath chungkhar hna chung i Aaron fapa hna kha, camcawh fung khiah in an ta a si caah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Judah ram chung i Hebron khua le a pawngkam saṭil tlonnak ram cu, annih cu pek an si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw khuapi pawngkam lo hna le khuate hna cu Jefunneh fapa Kaleb kha an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Aaron fapa hna kha himnak khua kha an pek hna: Hebron, Libnah le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna Jattir, Eshtemoa le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Hilen le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna Debir le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ashan le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, le Beth-shemesh le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />cun Benjamin phun chungin, Geba le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Alemeth le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, le Anathoth le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna. An innchungkhar dihlak in an khua vialte hna cu hleithum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Kohath mi a tang rihmi hna cu camcawh fung khiah in, phun cheu, Manasseh phun cheu chung khan, khua pahra pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Cun Gershon mi hna kha, an innchungkhar ning cio in, Issakhar phun le Asher phun le Naftali phun le Bashan i Manasseh phun chungin khua hleithum voh an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Merari mi hna cu, an innchungkhar ning cio in, Reuben phun le Gad phun le Zebulun phun chungin khua hleihnih voh an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Cuticun Israel mi hna nih Levi mi hna cu khua kha an saṭil tlonnak ram hna he khan an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Judah phun le Simeon phun le Benjamin phun chung zong hi khua an min in chimmi hna hi camcawh fung khiah in an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Cun Kohath fapa hna i an innchungkhar a cheu hna nih khan an ram chung khua an comi cu Efraim phun comi ram chung khan an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Annih cu himnak khua kha pek an si: Efraim tlangram i a ummi Shekhem kha a saṭil tlonnak ram hna he, Gezer cu a saṭil tlonnak ram hna he,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Jokmeam kha a saṭil tlonnak ram hna he, Beth-horon kha a saṭil tlonnak ram hna he,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Aijalon kha a saṭil tlonnak ram hna he, Gathrimmon kha a saṭil tlonnak ram hna he,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />cun Kohath innchungkhar a tang rihmi hna caah Manasseh phun cheu chung khan Aner kha a saṭil tlonnak ram hna he, cun Bileam kha a saṭil tlonnak ram hna he pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Gershon mi hna cu hi ram hi pek an si; Manasseh phun cheu chung khan Bashan i Golan kha a saṭil tlonnak ram hna he, cun Ashtaroth le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Issakhar phun chungin Kedesh le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Daberath le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Ramoth le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Anem le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Asher phun chungin Mashal le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Abdon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Hukok le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Rehob le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />cun Naftali phun chungin Galilee i Kedesh le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Hammon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, le Kiriathaim le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Merari mi a tang rihmi hna cu mah hihi pek an si: Zebulun phun chungin, Rimmono le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Tabor le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />cun Jordan khattelei ral Jeriko zawnah, Jordan nichuahlei kamah Reuben phun chungin, ramlak i a ummi Bezer le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Jahzah le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Kedemoth le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna, Mefaath le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />cun Gad phun chungin; Gilead i a ummi Ramoth le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Heshbon le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna le Jazer le a saṭil tlonnak ram hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Issakhar fapa hna: Tola, Puah, Jashub, le Shimron, pali an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tola fapa hna: Uzzi, Refaiah, Jeriel, Jahmai, Ibsam, le Shemuel, annih hi an pupa Tola innchungkhar hna chung i lu cio an si, anmah chan i a ṭhawngmi ralkap an si i David chan ah khan sang hnih le thong hnih le za ruk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzzi fapa hna: Izrahiah. Cun Izrahiah fapa hna cu, Mikhael, Obadiah, Joel, le Isshiah, panga, an dihlak in mi hruitu an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />cun an sin i rel chihmi, anmah le an chan ning cio in, an pupa hna innchungkhar ningin, raltu khomi ralkapbu minung sang thum le thong ruk an um, zeitintiah nupi tampi le fapa tampi an ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An rualchan Issakhar phun vialte chung i a ummi hna cu an chuahkeh ningin minthlak in, an dihlak ah ralkap ṭhawng sang riat le thong sarih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Benjamin fapa hna: Bela, Bekher, le Jediael, pathum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bela fapa hna: Ezbon, Uzzi, Uzziel, Jerimoth le Iri, panga, an pale chungkhar hna lu cio, ralkap ṭhawng an si; cun an chuahkehning in cazin khumhning ah sang hnih le thong hnih, sawm thum le pali an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bekher fapa hna; Zemirah, Joash, Eliezer, Eli-o-enai, Omri, Jeremoth, Abijah, Anathoth, le Alemeth.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mah hna hi Bekher fapa an si dih; cun an chuahkehnak ningin cazin khumhnak ah, an chan ningin an pale innchungkhar hna lu cio an sining khan, ralkap ṭhawng an si i sang hnih le za hnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jediael fapa: Bilhan. Bilhan fapa hna: Jeush, Benjamin, Ehud, Khenaanah, Zethan, Tarshish, le Ahishahar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mah vialte hi Jediael fapa cu an si, an pale cio innchungkhar lu cio an si ning khan, annih cu ralkap ṭhawng, ral doh awk i timh cia in a ummi an si, sang khat thong sarih le za hnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Shuppim le Huppim cu Ir fapa kha an si i Aher fapa hna cu Hushim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naftali fapa hna: Jahziel, Guni, Jezer, le Shallum, Bilhah tefa kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasseh fapa hna: Asriel, amah cu a nupichun Aramean minu nih a hrin; amah nih cun Gilead pa Makhir kha a hrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Makhir nih Huppim le Shuppim cu nupi a ṭhitpiak hna. A farnu min cu Maakah a si. A pahnihnak min cu Zelofehad a si; cun Zelofehad nih fanu a ngeih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Makhir nupi Maakah nih fapa a hrin i a min ah Peresh a sak; cun a unau min cu Sheresh a si; cun a fapa hna cu Ulam le Rakem an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ulam fapa cu Bedan a si. Hi hna hi Manasseh fapa Makhir i fapa Gilead i a fapa hna cu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun a farnu Hammolekheth nih Ishhod, Abiezer le Mahlah a hrin hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Shemida fapa hna cu Ahian, Shekhem, Likhi, le Aniam an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Efraim fapa hna cu a chan chan in hihi an si. Shuthelah, Bered, Tahath, Eleadah, Tahath,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zabad, Shuthelah. Shuthelah hleiah Efraim nih fapa dang pahnih a ngeih hna: Ezer le Elead an si; anmah cu cuka ram Gad mi hna saṭil an fir ruang i an rak thahmi hna kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun an pa Efraim nih ni tampi a ngai hna i amah hnemh awkah cun a unau hna kha an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun Efraim cu a nupi sinah a vung lut i fa a pawi i fapa pakhat a hrin i a innchungkhar chungah ṭhat lonak a tlun caah a min ah Beriah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A fanu cu Sheerah a si, amah nih cun Beth-horon tangnung le Beth-horon cungnung le Uzzen-sheerah kha a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun a fapa cu Refah a si, cu fapa cu Reshef, cu fapa cu Telah, cu fapa cu Tahan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />cu fapa cu Ladan, cu fapa cu Ammihud, cu fapa cu Elishama,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />cu fapa cu Nun, cu fapa cu Joshua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Annih nih an covo le an umnak cu Bethel le a pawngkam khua hna, nichuahlei ah Naaran le nitlaklei ah Gezer le a khua hna, Shekhem le a khua hna, Ayyah le a khua hna, an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />cun Manasseh mi hna ramri thluahmah zongah Beth-shean le a khua hna, Taanak le a khua hna, Megiddo le a khua hna, Dor le a khua hna an si. Hi hna chungah hin Israel fapa Josef i a fapa hna cu khua an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asher fapa hna: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah le an far Serah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Beriah fapa hna: Heber le Malkhiel, amah cu Birzaith pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Heber cu Jaflet, Shomer le Hotham le an far Shua pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jaflet fapa hna: Pasak, Bimhal le Ashvath. Mah hna hi Jaflet fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A unau Shomer fapa hna: Rohgah, Jehubbah le Aram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A unau Hotham fapa hna: Zofah, Imna, Shelesh le Amal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Zofah fapa hna: Suah, Harnefer, Shual, Beri, Imrah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bezer, Hod, Shamma, Shilshah, Isthran le Bera.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Jether fapa hna Jefunneh, Pispa, le Ara.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ulla fapa hna: Arah, Hanniel le Rizia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mah hna vialte hi Asher mi, an pale innchungkhar cio i an lu hna an hnatlakmi hna, ralkap ṭhawng bawi hna lak i upa bik an si. An chuahkehnak ningin raldohnak ca i minthlak tikah mi sang hnih le thong ruk an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin cu a fater Bela, a pahnihnak Ashbel, a pathumnak Aharah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a palinak Nohah le a panganak Rafa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Bela nih fapa a ngeih hna: Addar, Gera, Abihud,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gera, Shefufan le Huram an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mah hna hi Ehud fapa cu an si (annih cu Geba i khua a sami hna an pale innchungkhar hna he an si i Manahath ah sal ah kalpi an si):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Naaman, Ahijah le Gera, Gera cu Heglam kha a si, amah cu Uzza le Ahihud pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Shaharaim nih a nupile Hushim le Baara kha a ṭhawl hna hnuah Moab ram chungah fapa a ngeih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nupi Hodesh in fapa a hrin hna: Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malkam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jeuz, Sakhia, le Mirmah. Mah hna hi a fapa an si, pale innchungkhar lu cio an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hushim sin zongin fapa a ngeih hna: Abitub, le Elpaal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elpaal fapa hna: Eber le Misham, cun Ono le Lod an khua hna he a sertu Shemed
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cun Beriah le Shema (annih cu Gath i a ummi hna a ṭhiotu Aijalon i khua a sami hna pale hna innchungkhar hna i lu kha an si).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />cun Ahio, Shashak, le Jeremoth an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zebadiah, Arad, Eder,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mikhael, Ishpah le Joha hna cu Beriah fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ishmerai, Izliah, le Jobab hna cu Elpaal fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakim, Zikhri, Zabdi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Adaiah, Beraiah le Shimrath hna cu Shimei fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ishpan, Eber, Eliel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abdon, Zikhri, Hanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ifedeiah le Penuel hna cu Shashak fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jaareshiah, Elijah le Zikhri hna cu Jeroham fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi hna hi pale innchungkhar lu, anmah le an chan ning cio in, hruitu an si. Mah hna hi Jerusalem ah khua an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gibeon pa Jeiel cu Gibeon ah khua a sa i a nupi min cu Maakah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A fater cu Abdon a si, a hun changtu ah Zur, Kish, Baal, Nadab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Gedor, Ahio, Zekher
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />le Mikloth (amah cu Shimeah pa kha a si). Hi hna zong hi Jerusalem i a ummi an rualchan hna ralchan ah khan an rualchan hna he khua an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ner cu Kish pa a si, Kish cu Saul pa a si, Saul cu Jonathan, Malkhishua, Abinadab le Eshbaal pa a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />cun Jonathan fapa cu Meribbaal a si; Meribbaal cu Mikah pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mikah fapa hna: Pithon, Melek, Tarea, le Ahaz.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahaz cu Jehoaddah pa a si; cun Jehoaddah cu Alemeth le Zimri pa a si; Zimri cu Moza pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Moza cu Binea pa a si, a fapa ah Rafah, cu fapa ah Eleasah, cu fapa ah Azel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Azel nih fapa paruk a ngeih hna i mah hihi an min a si. Azrikam, Bokheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, le Hanan. Mah hna hi Azel fapa an si dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A unau Eshek fapa hna. A fater Ulam a pahnihnak Jeush, a pathumnak Elifelet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ulam fapa hna cu ralkap ṭhawng, li le thalkah thiam, fapa tampi le tufa tampi a ngeimi an si, za khat le sawm nga an si. Hi hna hi Benjamin mi an si dih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuticun Israel mi vialte cu an chuahkehnak ning cio in minthlak an si i mah cucu Israel Siangpahrang hna Cauk chungah ṭial an si. Cun Judah cu zumhawktlak a si lo ruangah Babilon ah sal ah kalpi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun an covo an khua hna chung i a um ṭhan hmasa bik hna cu Israel mi, tlangbawi hna, Levi mi hna, le biaknak inn i rianṭuantu hna kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Judah mi tlawmpal, Benjamin mi tlawmpal, Efraim mi tlawmpal le Manasseh mi tlawmpal hna cu Jerusalem ah an um:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ammihud fapa Uthai, Ammihud cu Omri fapa, Omri cu Imri fapa, Imri cu Bani fapa, Bani cu Judah fapa Perez fapa hna chung i a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Shilon mi hna chungin fater Asaiah le a fapa hna an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zerah fapa hna chungin Jeuel le a rualchan an si, za ruk sawm kua an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamin mi hna chungin Meshullam fapa Sallu, Meshullam cu Hodaviah fapa, Hodaviah cu Hassenuah fapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jehoram fapa Ibneiah, Uzzi fapa Elah, Uzzi cu Mikhri fapa, le Shefatiah fapa Meshullam, Shefatiah cu Reuel fapa, Reuel cu Ibnijah fapa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />le an chan ning cio in an rualchan hna cu an si, za kua le sawm nga le paruk an si. Mah hna hi hi an pale innchungkhar ning cio in an pale innchungkhar hna lu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlangbawi hna lakin Jedaiah, Jehoiarib Jakhin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />le Azariah Hilkiah fapa, Hilkiah cu Meshullam fapa, Meshullam cu Zadok fapa, Zadok cu Meraioth fapa, Meraioth cu Ahitub fapa, Ahitub cu Pathian inn i bawi ngan bik a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />cun Adaiah, amah cu Jeroham fapa, Jeroham cu Pashhur fapa, Pashhur cu Malkhijah fapa, cun Maasai, amah cu Adiel fapa, Adiel cu Jahzerah fapa, Jahzerah cu Meshullam fapa, Meshullam cu Meshillemith fapa, Meshillemith cu Immer fapa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />mah hna hi an rualchan an pale chungkhar hna i an lu hna lengah, thong khat za sarih le sawm ruk an si, Pathian inn rian ca i mi ṭhawng ngaingai an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi mi lakin: Shemaiah, Hasshub fapa, Hassub cu Azrikam fapa, Azrikam cu Merari fapa hna lak i Hashabiah fapa a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />cun Bakbakkar, Heresh, Galal le Mattaniah, Mattaniah cu Mikah fapa; Mikah cu Zikhri fapa, Zikhri cu Asaf fapa;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />cun Obadiah, amah cu Shemaiah fapa, Shemaiah cu Galal fapa, Galal cu Jeduthun fapa, le Berekhiah an si, Berekhiah cu Netofah mi hna khuate i a ummi Elkanah fapa Asa i a fapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kutka cawngtu hna cu: Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, Ahiman, le an rualchan an si; (Shallum cu an bawi bik a si),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />annih cu hi hlanah cun nichuahlei kam i siangpahrang kutka ah khan chiah an si. Levi mi riahhmun hna kutka cawngtu cu mah hna hi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Shallum, amah cu Kore fapa, Kore cu Ebiasaf fapa, Ebiasaf cu Korah fapa, cun a pa innchungkhar a rualchan hna, Korah mi hna nih biaknak rian zohkhenhtu le thlam innkahram zohkhenhtu an si, an pupa hna cu Bawipa riahhmun zohkhenhtu le luhnak zohkhenhtu an rak si bang khan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun hlan ah cun annih a rak uktu hna cu Eleazar fapa Phinehas kha a si; amah sinah cun Pathian a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meshelemiah fapa Zekhariah cu tonnak thlam luhnak ah kutka cawngtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi hna vialte, innkahram i kutka cawngtu ah thimmi hna cu za hnih le hleihnih an si. Annih cu an khua cio ah khan an chuahkehnak ningin minthlak an si. David le hmutu Samuel nih khan annih cu zumhawktlak an rian ah khan an fehter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cucaah anmah le an fapa hna nih khan Bawipa inn kutka hna cu an zohkhenh hna, mah cucu thlam inn kha a si, annih cu a cawngtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kutka cawngtu hna cu a kam lei ah khan an um, nichuahlei, nitlaklei, chaklei, thlanglei kamah khan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />cun an rualchan hna an khua cio i a ummi hna kha ni sarih dan lengmang ah, hi hna he um awkah an rat lengmang awk a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />zeicahtiah kutka cawngtu upa bik pali, Levi mi a simi hna kha, Pathian inn chung dal hna le chawhlawn hna zohkhenhtu kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun annih cu Pathian inn velchum ah khan an riak; zeicahtiah a cawngh le zingfate in innka hun cu anmah rian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A cheu khat cu rianṭuannak umkheng zohkhenh kha an rian a si, zeicahtiah an rak put hna le an lak tik hna ah an rel hna awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cheu khat hna cu ṭhutdan cabuai zohkhenhtu le a thiangmi umkheng vialte zohkhenhtu le, changvut dip zong a zohkhenhtu le, mitsur hang, chiti, zihmui, le rimhmui zohkhenhtu ah khan an thiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A dang pawl, tlangbawi fapa hna nih khan, rimhmui cawh awk kha an timhtuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />cun Levi mi pakhat Mattithiah kha changreu thlum a per tete tuah uktu a si, amah cu Korah mi Shallum fapa upa bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cun Kohath mi an unau hna a cheu khat zong kha, Sabbath kip i timh awkah hun camcinmi changreu tuah cu an rian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hi hna hi hlasatu cu an si, annih cu Levi mi pale innchungkhar hna lu cio kha an si, annih cu biakinn chung dal ah khan an um, chun zan in rian thiah an si caah rian dang khan cun an luat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mah hna hi Levi mi pale hna innchungkhar lu, an chan ning cio in an si, hruaitu an si, i Jerusalem ah khan an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gibeon ah Gibeon pa Jeiel kha a um, a nupi min cu Maakah a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />cun a fater cu Abdon a si, cu dih cun Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Gedor, Ahio, Zekhariah, le Mikloth an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />cun Mikloth cu Shimeam pa a si; cun hi hna zong hi Jerusalem i a ummi an rualchan hna ralchan ah khan an rualchan hna he khua an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ner cu Kish pa a si, Kish cu Saul pa a si, Saul cu Jonathan, Malkhishua, Abinadab le Eshbaal pa a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />cun Jonathan fapa cu Meribbaal a si, i Meribbaal cu Mikah pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Mikah fapa hna: Pithon, Melek, Tahrea, le Ahaz;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />cun Ahaz cu Jarah pa a si, Jarah cu Alemeth Azmaveth le Zimri pa a si; Zimri cu Moza pa a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Moza cu Binea pa a si; cun Refaliah cu a fapa a si, Refaliah fapa cu Eleasah a si, Eleasah fapa cu Azel a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Azel nih cun fapa paruk a ngeih hna i mah hihi an min cu an si: Azrikam, Bokheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah, le Hanan; hi hna hi Azel fapa cu an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Filistin mi hna nih Israel mi cu an tuk hna i Filistin mi hna hmai cun Israel mi cu an zam i Gilboa Tlang ah khan an ril liangluang ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Filistin mi nih Saul le a fapa hna kha an phak hna i Filistin mi hna nih cun Saul fapa Jonathan le Abinadab le Malkhishua kha an thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Saul cu heh tiah an nam i thal kah thiammi hna nih khan an phak ai; cun thal kah thiam hna nih khan an hliam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Saul nih a ralthuam putu sinah khan, “Na nam kha i zuh law tleng lak in ka chun, cu ti a si lo ahcun, cuarpartanlo pawl hi an ra lai i lentecelhnak ah an ka ser sual lai,” tiah a ti. Sihmanhsehlaw a ralthuam putu nih khan a tuah duh lo; zeicahtiah a thin a phang ngaingai. Cucaah Saul nih amah vainam kha aa lak i a bawhkhuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun a ralthuam putu nih Saul kha a thi cang tiah a hmuh tikah amah zong nih a vainam kha a bawhkhuh ve i a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuticun Saul cu a thi; amah le a fapa pathum hna le a innchungkhar vialte cu hmun khat ah an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun nelrawn chungah a ummi Israel mi vialte nih ralkap kha an zam i Saul le a fapa hna kha an thi, ti an theih tikah, an khua kha an chuahtak hna i an zam; cun Filistin mi kha an ra i an khua kha an rawlh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thaizing ah Filistin mi hna nih a thimi kha an thilthuam hawh awk i an rat tikah, Saul le a fapa hna Gilboa Tlang i an thih kha an hmuh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thilthuam kha an hawh i a lu le a ralthuam kha an lak i an siasal hna le mi zapi hna sin i thawng ṭha cu kalpi awkah Filistin mi ram dihlak ah khan lamkal an thlah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun a ralthuam cu an pathian hna biakinn ah khan an chiah i a lu cu Dagon biakinn chungah khan an tar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Jebesh-gilead mi vialte nih Saul cung i Filistin mi nih an tuahmi vialte kha an theih tikah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ralṭha vialte cu an tho i Saul ruak le a fapa hna ruak kha an va lak hna i Jabesh ah an ratpi hna. Cun an ruh cu Jabesh i kuhthing toiah an vui hna i ni sarih rawl an ul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuticun zumhawktlak a si lo ruangah Saul cu a thi; Bawipa sinah zumh tlak a si lonak cu Bawipa nawlbia a zulh lonak kha le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa sinin lam hmuhsaknak kawl loin khuavang thitlawnthiam sin tu in lam hmuhsaknak kha a kawl i a hal kha a si. Cucaah Bawipa nih a thah i pennak cu Jesse fapa David sinah khan a pek.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Israel phun vialte kha Hebron ah David sinah, hmunkhat ah an i pum i annih nih, “Zohhmanh, kannih cu na ruh le na sa kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kan hnulei caan, Saul siangpahrang a si lio hmanh ah khan, Israel mi a chuahpitu le a luhpitu cu nangmah na si; cun Bawipa na Pathian nih nangmah cu, ‘Ka mi Israel mi hna cungah tuukhal na si lai i ka mi Israel mi hna cungah bawi na si lai,’ an ti,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cucaah Israel mi upa vialte kha siangpahrang sinah cun Hebron ah khan an ra; cun David nih annih he cun Bawipa hmaiah Hebron ah khan biakamnak a ser i annih nih Samuel sinin Bawipa bia a rami ning khan, David cu Israel mi siangpahrang ah chiti an thuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun David le Israel mi vialte cu Jerusalem ah an kal, mah cucu Jebus a si, cuka ah cun cuka ram i a ummi Jebus mi hna cu an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jebus i a ummi hna nih cun David cu an thawh i, “Hika ah hin na ra lut lai lo,” an ti. Asinain David nih Zion ralhau cu a lak, mah cucu David khua timi cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David nih, “Jebus mi a tu hmasa bik paoh cu ralbawi bik a si lai,” tiah a ti. Cun Zeruiah fapa Joab cu a hung kal hmasa bik i cucaah ralbawi bik ah cun a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun David cu ralhau chungah cun khua a sa; cucaah mah cucu David khua tiah ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun khua cu a velchum in, Millo thawk in a kulhnak tling tein a ser; cun Joab nih khua cu remh awk a tang rihmi kha a remh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun David cu, ralkapbu Bawipa kha a sinah a um caah, a ngan chin lengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mah hna hi David miṭhawng hna upa bikbik cu an si, Israel mi kong i Bawipa bia ning khan, amah kha siangpahrang i ser awkah Israel mi vialte hna he hmunkhat ah a pennak chungah khan fak piin an bawmh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mah hihi David miṭhawng hna kong cu a si: Hakhmon mi Jashobeam hi pathum hna lak i haotu bik a si, amah nih minung za thum ṭum khat i a thahmi hna cungah khan fei a hman.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun miṭhawng pathum hna lak i amah a hun changtu cu Ahohimi Dodo i fapa Eleazar kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Filistin mi hna cu raldoh awk i Pas-dammim ah an i pumh tikah, khika ah amah cu David sinah khan a um. Khika ah hmun pakhat a um i barli in a khat i mi hna cu Filistin mi hna sin cun an zam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw cu hmun laifang ah cun a dir hmun aa serh i cuka hmun cu a humhak i Filistin mi kha a thah hna; cun Bawipa nih teinak ngan piin a khamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Haotu bik sawm thum hna lak i pathum hna kha, Filistin ralkapbu cu Refaim nelrawn i an riah lioah, David sinah Adullam lungkua lungpi ah khan an vung kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cu lioah cun David cu ralhruang chungah a um i Filistin mi ralvengtu ralkap hna cu Bethlehem ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun David nih ti kha a ngai ruangmang i, “Bethlehem tikhor, hauka pawng i a ummi ti kha din awkah a ka petu hei um hna seh law, ka hei duh hnga dah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khi tikah miṭhawng pathum hna nih khan Filistin mi hna riahhmun chung cun an va lan i Bethlehem tikhor, hauka pawng i a ummi chung khan ti cu an va than an va lak i David sinah an ratpi. Sihmanhsehlaw David nih din a duh lo; Bawipa hmaiah khan a bungh i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Hi mi hna nunnak thi hi ka din ko hnga maw? Zeitintiah annih nih thih le thih ti in an rak putmi a si,” tiah a ti. Cucaah cun din cu a duh lo. Mah thil hna cu miṭhawng pathum hna nih khan an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Joab unau Abishai kha sawm thum hna lak i haotu bik cu a si. Cun mi za thum hna cungah fei a hman i a thah hna i pathum hna sinah khan a thang aa chuah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amah cu sawm thum hna lakah khan cun min thang bik a si i an haotu ah a cang, sihmanhsehlaw pathum hna kha cu a khingkhang hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehoiada fapa Benaiah cu Kabzeel khuami miralṭha, thil lianngan a tuahtu a si; amah nih Moab ariel pahnih a thah hna. Cun hawhra a tlak ni ah khan a vung kal i chiandeih pakhat zong khor chungah a thah fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun Izipt mipa pakhat, a ngan ngaingai i a tung dong nga a sangmi kha a thah. Izipt mipa nih cun thiam tlang bantuk a simi fei pakhat aa put; sihmanhsehlaw Benaiah nih cun thing thluan he a vun fuh i Izipt mipa cu a kut chungin fei kha a chuh i amah fei lila cun a thah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mah thil hna hi Jehoiada fapa Benaiah nih khan a tuah hna i miṭhawng pathum hna sinah khan a thang aa chuah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sawm thum hna lakah khan a min a thang ve, sihmanhsehlaw pathum hna kha cu a khingkhang hna lo. Cun David nih a pum ralvengtu haotu ah a chiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ralkapbu hna chung i miṭhawng hna cu Asahel Joab unau, Bethlehem khuami Dodo fapa Elhanan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Harod khuami Shammoth, Pelon mi Helez,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tekoa khuami Ikkesh fapa Ira, Anathoth khuami Abiezer,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hushath mi Sibbekai, Ahohimi Ilai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Netofah khuami Maharai, Netofah khuami Baanah fapa Heled,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin mi hna khua Gibeah mi Ribai fapa Ithai, Pirathon mi Benaiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Gaash i tivarek hna mi Hurai, Arbath mi Abiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Baharum mi Azmaveth, Shaalbon mi Eliahba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Gizon mi Hashem, Harar mi Shagee fapa Jonathan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harar mi Sakher fapa Ahiam, Ur fapa Elifal,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Mekherath mi Hefer, Pelon mi Ahijah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Karmel mi Hezro, Ezbai fapa Naarai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nathan unau Joel, Hagri fapa Mibhar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ammon mi Zelek, Beeroth khuami Naharai, amah cu Zeruiah fapa Joab hriamnam putu a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ithra mi Ira, Ithra mi Gareb,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hit mi Uriah, Ahlai fapa Zabad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Reuben mi Shiza fapa Adina, amah cu Reuben mi le amah sin i a ummi sawm thum haotu a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Maakah fapa Hanan le Mithni mi Joshafat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ashterath mi Uzzia, Aroer mi Hotham fapa Shama le Jeiel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Shimri fapa Jediael le a unau Joha, Tiz mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Mahav mi Eliel, Elnaam fapa Jeribai le Joshaviah le Moab mi Ithmah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />le Mezoba mi Eliel Obed le Jaasiel an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kish fapa Saul ruang i David cu duhduh in aa chawh aa leh khawh lo lioah khan mah hna hi David sin i Ziklag khua ah a ummi a mi cu an si; annih hi ral lio i amah a bawmtu miṭhawng hna lakah khan an i tel ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Li hman thiammi an si i thal kah siseh, lungherh cheh siseh, an orhlei kut he an kehlei kut he an thiam; annih cu Benjamin mi, Saul rualchan kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An haotu bik cu Ahiezer a si, a hun changtu cu Joash a si, an pahnih in Gibeah khuami Shemaah fapa an si; Azmaveth fapa Jeziel le Pelet zong; Berakah, Anathoth mi Jehu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gibeon mi Ishmaiah, amah cu sawm thum hna lakah miṭhawng a si i sawm thum hna cung i haotu a si; Jeremiah, Jahaziel, Johanan, Gederah mi Jozabad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Eluzai, Jerimoth, Bealiah, Shemariah, Haruf mi Shefatiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Elkanah, Isshiah, Azrel, Joezer, le Jashobeam, mah hna hi Korath mi an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />cun Gedor mi Jeroham fapa hna Joelah le Zebadiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gad mi hna chungin a ṭhawng i a thiam ngaingaimi ralkap hna, phaw hman le fei hman a thiam ngaingaimi, an hmai chiandeih hmai a lo i tlang cung sazuk bantukin a mar a zaangmi hna kha David sinah ramlak i ralhruang ah khan an va kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cu hna cu: Haotu bik Ezer, a pahnihnak Obadiah, pathumnak Eliab,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />palinak Mishmannah, panganak Jeremiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />paruknak Attai, pasarihnak Eliel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />pariatnak Johanan, pakuanak Elzabad,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />pahranak Jeremiah, hleikhatnak Makbannai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi Gad mi hna hi ralkap bawi an si, a hme deuh pawl hi za haotu an si i a ngan deuh pawl hi thong haotu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi hna hi thla khatnak thla i Jordan tiva a kuang vialte a khah dih lio i a tantu, cun cu nelrawn chung i a ummi vialte nichuahlei le nitlaklei i a dawi dihtu kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Benjamin mi tlawmpal le Judah mi tlawmpal cu David sinah ralhruang ah khan an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Annih ton awkah khan David cu a va chuak i, “Hawikomhnak in keimah bawmh awkah nan rat a si ahcun, ka lung cu nannih sinah ṭhit chih a si lai; sihmanhsehlaw ka ral hna sinah, ka kut chungah zeihmanh sualnak a um lo nain, rawi awk i nan rat a si ahcun, kan pupa hna Pathian nih in hmu hna seh law in mawhchiat ko hna seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khi tikah sawm thum hna lak i haotu bik Amasai cungah khan Thlarau a tlung i amah nih cun hi bangin a ti: “Kannih cu nangmah ta kan si, maw David; Maw Jesse fapa, nangmah sin tel kan si; Daihnak, daihnak cu na sinah um ko seh, Daihnak cu nangmah an bawmtu hna cungah um ko seh! Zeitintiah na Pathian nih an bawmh.” Khi tikah David nih tlun inn a onh hna i a ralkap hna haotu bawi ah khan a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David cu Saul doh awkah Filistin mi hna he an rat tikah, Manasseh mi cheukhat cu a sinah khan an zam. A ngaingai ti ahcun, Filistin mi kha a bawm hna lo, zeicahtiah Filistin siangpahrang hna nih khan hmasa a bawipa Saul sinah khan a kan lei sual lai ti an phang i Ziklag ah an kirter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anih cu Ziklag i a kal ah khan hi Manasseh mi hna hi a sin i an zam cu a si: Cu hna cu Adnah, Jozabad, Jediael, Michael, Jozabad, Elihu le Zillethai, Manasseh chung i a thong pawl haotu bik hna kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Annih nih David kha ralhranhtu bu hna doh kha an bawmh; zeitintiah annih cu miṭhawng ralṭha an si dih i ralkapbu haotu kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni fate ti awkin mi kha David sinah amah kha bawmh awkah an i fon i ralkapbu nganpi, Pathian ralkapbu bantuk ah a ralkapbu cu a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa bia ningin, Saul pennak cu David kha pek awkah amah sinah Hebron khua ah a rami hriamnam a ngeimi ralkap hna an i cheuning cu mahtihin a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah mi phaw le fei aa putmi hna cu hriamnam a ngeimi ralkap thong ruk le za riat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeon mi hna chungin raldohnak ca i ralṭhami thong sarih le za khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Levi mi hna chungin, thong li le za ruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aaron innchungkhar chung mi bawi Jehoiada le amah sin i a ummi thong thum le za sarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A ṭhawng i a ral a ṭhami tlangval Zadok le amah a pa innchungkhar chungin haotu pakul le pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Benjamin mi Saul rual chan hna chungin, thong thum, hi hlanah hin cun a tam deuh cu Saul innchungkhar sinah khan an ṭang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Efraim mi chungin, sang hnih le za riat, an pale innchungkhar cio ah miṭhawng, ralṭha le minthang an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Manasseh phun cheu chungin sang khat le thong riat, annih cu rat i David kha siangpahrang i ser awkah fiang tein min chim an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Issakhar chungin, caan a hngalthiammi le Israel nih zeidah a tuah awk a si ti a hngalthiammi haotu bik za hnih hna le anmah nih an ukmi hna an phun hawi vialte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Jebulun chungin, a fel taktakmi ralkap sang nga, annih cu David kha tinhmi pakhatte he bawmh awkah ral hriamnam in tling tein an i thuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Naftali chungin, ral bawi thong khat, an sinah cun ralkap phaw le fei he aa thuammi sang thum le thong sarih an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Dan mi chungin, raltuk awk i aa thuammi sang hnih le thong riat le za ruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Asher chungin, a fel taktakmi, raltuk awk i timh cia in a ummi sang li.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jordan khattelei ral i a ummi Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheu hna chungin, sing khat le sang hnih, raldohnak hriamnam in tling tein aa thuammi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hi ralkap vialte hna, raldohnak hmun i chuah awkah timh cia tein a ummi hna cu, David kha Israel siangpahrang ah kan ser hrimhrim lai tiah i tim in Hebron ah an ra; cu bantuk ṭhiamṭhiam in Israel mi vialte hna zong cu David kha siangpahrang i ser awkah lungkhat tein an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Annih cu David sinah khan ni thum an um i an ei i an ding, zeicahtiah an unau hna nih khan an rak timhtuahpiak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cun an innpa hna zong nih khan, Issakhar le Zebulun le Naftali ram hna tiang i a ummi hna nih khan, laa in le kalauk in le khacer in le cawtum in rawl le ei awk phun tling, theipi car hlum hna, mitsur car bor hna, mitsur hang, chiti, cawtum hna le tuu hna kha an rak phorh hna, zeicahtiah Israel ram chungah lawmhnak a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nih a thong pawl haotu hna le a za pawl haotu hna le haotu paohpaoh kha lungthin cheuh awk a hal hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun David nih Israel mi aa pummi vialte cu a thawh hna i, “Nannih nih a ṭha tiah nan ruah i Bawipa kan Pathian duhnak a si ahcun, Israel ram chung i a um rihmi kan unau hna le an sin i a ummi tlangbawi hna le Levi mi hna, saṭil tlonnak ram a ngeimi khua chung i a ummi hna kha, kan sinah i pumh ve awkah an rat nakhnga, hei sawm hna u sih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun kan Pathian kuang kha kan sinah ratpi ṭhan u sih; zeicahtiah Saul chan lioah khan kannih nih kan rak daithlanh ai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aa pummi vialte nih cu bantukin tuah awkah an hna a tla, zeicahtiah cu thil cu mi vialte mithmuhnak ah thil dik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cucaah David nih Israel mi vialte cu Izipt ram tiva Shihor in Hamath luhnak tiang Kiriath-jearim in Jerusalem Pathian kuang cu ratpi awkah, a pumh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun David le Israel mi vialte cu Baalah ah khan an hung kal, cucu Judah ta a simi Kiriath-jearim kha a si; cherubim hna cungah a ṭhumi Bawipa min in kawhmi Pathian kuang va lak awkah khan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun annih nih Abinadab inn khan Pathian kuang cu cawleng thar cungin an kalpi i Uzza le Ahio nih khan cawleng cu an mawngh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun David le Israel mi vialte kha Pathian hmaiah cun an thazang dihlak le hla le tingtang le thonglawi le khuang tete le sumsel le muko he tiah thanuam in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Khidon phuhri an va phak tikah, cawtum cu an lumhrilh caah Uzza nih cun kuang kha tlaih awkah a kut in a hei banh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Bawipa thinhunnak cu Uzza cungah cun a alh i kuang kha a hei banh caah a thah i cuka ah cun Pathian hmaiah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Uzza cungah a thinhunnak a langhter caah David cu a thin a hung i cuka hmun cu nihin ni tiang hin Perez-uzza tiah ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun David nih Pathian cu khi ni ah a ṭih i, “Zeitindah inn ah ka sinah Pathian kuang cu ka ratpi khawh lai?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cucaah David nih inn ah David khua chungah khan kuang cu a luhpi lo, sihmanhsehlaw Git mi Obededom inn ah khan a kalpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Pathian kuang cu Obededom inn chungah khan a innchungkhar hna he thla thum a um; cun Bawipa nih Obededom innchungkhar le a ngeihmi vialte cu thluachuah a pek hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Tair siangpahrang Hiram nih David kha lamkaltu le sidar thing le lungremh thiam le zungthiam hna zong kha amah cu inn sakpiak awkah a kuat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun David nih, Bawipa nih Israel mi cungah siangpahrang ah a ka fehter cang, ti le a mi Israel mi hna ruangah ka pennak cu sangpi ah hlorh a si cang ti kha a hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun David nih Jerusalem ah khan nupi aa lak chap hna i David cu fapa tam chinchin le fanu tam chinchin a ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mah hna hi Jerusalem ah a hrinmi a fale hna min cu a si: Shammua, Shobab, Nathan, Solomon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ibhar, Elishua, Elpelet,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nogah, Nefeg, Jafia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Elishama, Beeliada, le Elifelet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Filistin mi nih David kha Israel vialte cung i siangpahrang ah chiti thuh a si cang ti kha an theih tikah, Filistin mi vialte cu David kawl ah khan an hung kal; cun mah cucu David nih a theih i annih doh awkah khan a chuak ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Filistin mi cu an ra i Refaim nelrawn kha an hranh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun David nih Pathian kha a hal i, “Filistin mi hna doh awkah ka hung kal lai maw? Annih cu ka kut chungah na ka pe hna hnga maw?” tiah a ti. Cun Bawipa nih amah cu. “Hung kal ko, annih cu na kut chungah kan pek hna lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Baal-perazim ah a hung kal i David nih khika ah a tei hna; cun David nih, “Pathian nih ka ral hna cu tilian aa sah phut bantukin a sah hna,” tiah a ti. Cucaah cuka hmun cu a min ah Baal-perazim ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun khika ah an pathian hna kha an kaltak hna i David nih nawl a pek hna i an khangh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Filistin mi hna nih cun nelrawn cu an hranh ṭhan hoi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun David nih Pathian kha a hal ṭhan tikah, Pathian nih amah cu, “Na hung dawi hna hnga lo; i vel law balsam kung hna zawn khin chuahhnawh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun balsam thing par hna i kal thawng na theih tikah, khi tikah raldohnak hmun ah cun va chuak tuah; Pathian cu na hmaiah, Filistin mi ralkapbu tuk awkah a kal cang,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun David nih Pathian nih nawl a pek bangin a tuah i Filistin ralkapbu cu Gibeon in Gezer tiang an thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun David minthannak nih cun ram vialte kha a cul dih i miphun vialte cungah amah ṭihnak kha Bawipa nih a tlunter.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nih amah caah David khua chungah khan inn a sak hna i Pathian kuang caah khan hmun pakhat a timh i thlam pakhat a bunhpiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun David nih, “Levi mi dah ti lo nih cun ahohmanh nih Pathian kuang cu i zawn hna hlah seh, zeitintiah annih cu Bawipa nih Bawipa kuang i zawnh awk le a rian ṭuan zungzal awkah a thim hna,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Bawipa kuang cu a ca i a timhmi hmun i hun kalpi awkah, David nih Israel mi vialte cu Jerusalem ah a pumh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun David nih Aaron fapa hna le Levi mi hna kha a pumh hna:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kohath fapa hna chung khan, haotu bik Uriel le a unau za khat le pakul;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Merari fapa hna lakin, haotu bik Asaiah le a unau za hnih le pakul;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gershom fapa hna chungin, haotu bik Joel le a unau za khat le sawm thum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Elizafan fapa hna chungin, haotu bik Shemaiah le a unau za hnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hebron fapa hna chungin, haotu bik Eliel le a unau sawm riat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Uzziel fapa hna chungin, haotu bik Amminadab le a unau za khat le hleihnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun David nih tlangbawi Zadok le Abiathar le Levi mi Uriel, Asaiah, Joel, Shemaiah, Eliel le Amminadab kha a kawh hna i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />annih cu, “Nannih cu Levi mi hna chung i pale innchungkhar hna lu cio nan si; nannih nih Bawipa Israel Pathian kuang kha, ka timhpiakmi hmun ah cun nan hunpi nakhnga nan unau le he i thianh tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A voi hmasa bik ah khan nannih nih nan put lo caah Bawipa kan Pathian nih kan cungah a thinhunnak a langhter; zeicahtiah kannih nih hitin tuah awk a si lai ti i fehter ciami ning khan kan rak zohkhenh lo,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa, Israel Pathian kuang cu hun zawnh awkah tlangbawi hna le Levi mi hna cu an i thianh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Moses nih Bawipa bia ningin nawl a pek bangin, Pathian kuang cu Levi mi hna nih a lang hna khan an liang in an i zawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David nih Levi mi haotu bik hna kha, nannih nan unaule hna cu hlasatu lunglawmhnak thawng thanter awkah, aw dawh thilri fak piin a tum ding le tingtang le thonglawi le sumsel a tum dingah nan thiah hna lai, tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cucaah Levi mi hna nih cun mah hna hi an thiah hna: Joel fapa Herman le a unau hna Berekhiah fapa Asaf le an unau hna Merari fapa hna lakin Kushaiah fapa Ethan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />cun anmah sinah cun an unau hna dot hnihnak pawl, Zekhariah, Jaaziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Benaiah, Maaseiah, Matti-thiah, Elifelehu, le Mikneiah, cun kutka cawngtu Obededom le Jeiel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hlasatu Herman le Asaf le Ethan cu dar sumsel tumtu ding an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zekhariah, Azeiel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Maaseiah, le Benaiah cu Alamoth aw in tingtang tumtu ding an si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Mattithiah Elifelehu, le Mikneiah, Obededom, Jeiel le Azaziah hna cu Sheminith aw in thonglawi in hruaitu ding an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Levi mi hla ah a hruaitu hna Chenaniah nih hla cu a thiam caah a hruai awk hna a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Berekhiah le Elkanah cu kuang ca i kutka cawngtu an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shebaniah, Joshafat, Nethanel, Amasai, Zekhariah, Benaiah le Eliezer, tlangbawi hna nih Pathian kuang hmaiah muko kha an tum hna lai. Obededom le Jehiah zong kuang ca i kutka cawngtu an si ve lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cucaah David le Israel mi upa hna le a thong pawl haotu hna kha, Bawipa biakamnak kuang cu Obededom inn in lunglawmhnak he va lak awkah an kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun Bawipa biakamnak kuang a zawntu Levi mi hna cu Pathian nih a bawmh hna caah, annih nih cawtum pasarih le tuutum pasarih an thawi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />David cu lahmangṭhia angki fual in aa thuam, kuang a zawntu Levi mi vialte hna le hlasatu hna le hlasatu hna i an hla a hruaitu Khenaniah zong kha cu bantuk cun an i thuam ve; cun David cu laa in tahmi tlangbawi angki aa hruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuticun muko le saki le sumsel aw zulh cun Israel mi vialte nih au pah in Bawipa biakamnak kuang cu an hunpi i hla fak piin an sa i tingtang le thonglawi kha fak piin an tum hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Bawipa biakamnak kuang cu David khua i a rat lioah khan, Saul fanu Mikhal nih khan thlalangawng in a hei zoh i David Siangpahrang a lam len ko le aa nuamh len ko kha a hei hmuh i a lung chungin a nihsawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Pathian kuang cu an luhpi i David nih a bunhpiakmi thlam chungah khan an chiah; cun Pathian hmaiah khangh thawinak le daihnak thawinak kha an pekchanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun David nih khangh thawinak le daihnak thawinak pekchanh kha a dih tikah, mizapi cu Bawipa min in thluachuahnak a pek hna i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel mi vialte cu nu he pa he changreu hlum khat le sa zam khat le mitsur car hlum khat cio a phawt hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuhleiah Levi mi a cheukhat cu Bawipa kuang hmai i rianṭuantu ah, Bawipa, Israel Pathian sinah thlacam awk le lawmh awk le thangṭhat awkah, a thiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An haotu bik cu Asaf a si, a hun dottu ah Zekhariah, Jeiel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Mattithiah, Eliab, Benaiah, Obededom le Jeiel an si, annih cu tingtang le thonglawi tumtu ding an si; Asaf cu sumsel tumtu ding a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />cun tlangbawi Benaiah le Jahaziel cu Bawipa biakamnak kuang hmaiah muko a tum lengmang tu ding an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun khi ni ah khan David nih Bawipa sin i lawmhnak hla sak awkah Asaf le a unau rual cu a thiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawipa sinah lunglawmhnak bia chim tuah u, a min kha au tuah u, Mi zakip kha a tuahnak hngalhter hna u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hla in hlawrh tuah u, hla in thangṭhat tuah u, Khuaruahhar a rianṭuannak vialte kha chim tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A min thiang cu sunparnak ah hmang u, Bawipa a kawlmi hna lung kha i lawm hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa le a ṭhawnnak kha kawl tuah u, A hmai kha kawl lengmang tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tuahmi khuaruahhar rian le khuaruahharnak a tuahmi hna le Biakhiahnak a chimmi hna cu philh hlah u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Maw a sal Abraham tefa hna, Jakob fapa a thimmi hna!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah cu Bawipa, kan Pathian a si; A biakhiahnak cu vawlei khuazakip ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A biakamnak cu a hngalh zungzal A fehtermi a bia cu chan thong khat tiang a philh lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham he biakamnak a tuah, Isak sinah chiatser in bia a kam;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jakob sinah nawlbia a fehter, Israel sinah zungzal hmunmi biakamnak a tuah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Nangmah sinah Kanaan ram cu ro caah, Na covo ah kan pek lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi tlawmte an si i santlailo le khi ram chungah mipem an si i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miphun khat sinin phun khat sinah a vak i Ram khat in ramdang ah an kal tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahohmanh annih kha a hremter hna lo; Anmah ruangah siangpahrang kha a sik hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Chiti ka thuhmi hi tawng hna hlah u, Ka profet hna hi harnak pe hna hlah u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vawlei vialte hna, Bawipa sinah hla hun sa tuah u! Nifate in amah khamhnak kha chim tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Miphun hna lakah a sunparnak kha thanh tuah u, Mi vialte hna lakah, khuaruahhar a tuahnak zong!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zeitintiah Bawipa cu a lianngan i fak piin thangṭhat awk a si, Mi hna pathian vialte hna nakin amah cu ṭih awk a si deuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Zeitintiah mi hna pathian vialte cu siasal an si, Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa nih van khi a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Upatnak le lianngannak cu a hmaiah an um, Ṭhawnnak le lawmhnak cu a hmun chungah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Maw mizakip chung i miphun vialte hna, Bawipa sinah pe ko u, Bawipa sinah sunparnak le ṭhawnnak pe ko u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa cu amah min he aa tlakmi sunparnak cu pe ko u, Pekchanh awk rak i put u law a hmaika ah ra chuak tuah u! Thuam thianghlim in i thuam in Bawipa cu bia tuah u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vawlei vialte hna, amah hmaiah cun ther tuah u; Asi, vawlei cu fek tein a dir ko, aa hnin bal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Van hna khi i lawm ko hna seh, vawlei hi a tha nuam seh, “ Bawipa nih a pen,” tiah miphun kip sinah chim hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Rili le a chungah a ummi thil vialte awn hna seh, Lo le a chungah a ummi thil vialte kha i lawm hna seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khi tikah ramlak thingkung vialte cu Bawipa hmaiah lawmhnak in hla an sa lai, Zeitintiah vawlei kha biaceih awkah amah cu a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Bawipa cu lawm tuah u, zeitintiah amah cu a ṭha; Zeitintiah a fekmi a dawtnak cu zungzal in a hmun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Maw kan khamhnak Pathian kan chanh law Miphun hna chungin kan pum law kan khamh tuah, Zeitintiah na min thiang cu kan lawmh i Na thangṭhatnak cu kan i chawr nakhnga
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bawipa, Israel Pathian cu, zungzal in zungzal tiang thangṭhat si ko seh!” ti tuah u. Cun mi vialte nih, “Amen!” tiah an ti. Bawipa kha an thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cuticun David nih Asaf le a unau rual hna cu khika ah, Bawipa biakamnak kuang hmaiah cun, ni fate a herhnak bantukin rianṭuan zungzal awkah a chiahtak hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Obededom le a unau rual sawm ruk le pariat zong kha; Jeduthun fapa Obededom le Hosah tu cu kutka cawngtu caah khan an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cun tlangbawi Zadok le a unau hna tlangbawi hna kha Gibeon i a ummi khuahrum bo i Bawipa puan biakinn hmaiah khan a chiahtak hna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Bawipa nih Israel mi nawl a pekmi hna phungbia chung i aa ṭialmi vialte ningin, annih nih zinglei he zanlei he khangh thawinak biakṭheng cungah khan Bawipa sin i khangh thawinak kha an pekchanh thluangthluan awk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />An sinah cun Heman le Jeduthun le, Bawipa cu a fekmi a dawtnak kha zungzal in a hmunh caah a sinah lawmhnak bia chim awk ca i thimmi hna le fiang tein min chimmi a cheu hna kha an um,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Heman le Jeduthun nih hlasaknak caah khan muko le sumsel an ngeih hna i hla thiang caah khan hlasaknak thilri an ngeih hna. Jeduthun fapa hna cu kutka cawngh kha an thiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cun mi vialte cu an inn cio ah an ṭin i David cu a inn ah a innchungkhar hna thluachuah pek awkah a kal.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun David cu a inn ah khan a um i cu tikah, David nih cun profet Nathan cu a thawh i, “Zohhmanh, kei vial sidar thing inn chungah ka um i Bawipa biakamnak kuang tu cu puan thlam tangah a um,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Nathan nih David cu a thawh i, “Na lung chung a ummi paoh cu tuah ko, zeitintiah Pathian cu na sinah a um,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw cu zan ṭhiamṭhiam ah cun Bawipa bia cu Nathan sinah a ra i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Va kal law ka sal David kha, ‘Hi bangin Bawipa nih a ti: Ka umnak dingah inn ka sakpiak hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zeicahtiah Israel kha ka hun hruai ni thawk in atu tiang inn chungah ka um lo, sihmanhsehlaw thlam khat in thlam khat ah, umnak hmun pakhat in umnak hmun dang pakhat ah ka kal lengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel mi vialte he kaa chawhnak hmun dihlak ah, ka mi hna cawngh awk i nawl ka pekmi Israel mi biaceihtu hna aho sin tal ah, “Zeicahdah sidar inn na ka sakpiak lo?” tiah bia kaa khat tal ka chim maw? a ti,’ tiah va chim,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cucaah atu cu ka sal David kha hi bangin na va chimh lai, ‘Hi bangin ralkapbu Bawipa nih a ti, Nangmah cu ka mi Israel mi cungah bawi si awkah, phong lak, tuu na zulhkhalh hnanak khan kan lak:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />cun na kalnak kip ah nangmah sinah ka um i na hmai in na ral vialte kha ka hloh dih hna; cun vawlei cung milianngan hna min bantukin min kan serpiak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun ka mi Israel mi hna caah hmun pakhat ka tuah lai i anmah hmunte ah cun an um nakhnga le hnahnawh an si ti nakhnga lo, ka phun hna lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hlan lio i ka mi Israel mi hna cungah biaceihtu ka rak chiah hna caan bantuk khan, zaang-en hmangmi hna nih an hrawkhral ti hna lai lo; cun na ral vialte cu kan teipiak lai. Cuhleiah Bawipa nih nangmah cu inn pakhat an serpiak lai tiah kan thanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na pupa hna sin i um awkah na ni kha a tlin tikah, na hnuah na tefa, na fapa hna lak i pakhat cu a chan ka thawhter lai i a pennak cu ka fehter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keimah caah inn pakhat a sak lai i a bawi ṭhutdan cu zungzal in ka fehter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimah cu a pa ka si lai i amah cu ka fa a si lai; nangmah hlan i a rak ummi sinin a fekmi ka dawtnak ka rak lak bantuk khan a sinin ka la lai lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw ka inn chungah le ka pennak chungah amah cu ka fehter lai i a bawi ṭhutdan cu zungzal in a hmun lai,’ a ti,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi bia vialte ning le hi langhnak vialte ningin, Nathan nih David sinah cun a chim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khi tikah David cu a lut i Bawipa hmaiah khan a ṭhu i, “Maw Bawipa, Pathian, keimah cu ahodah ka si i ka innchungkhar zong hi zeidah an si, hi tiang nangmah nih na ka hruai hi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun mah hi cu nangmah mit ah cun, a hmemi thil a si ko, maw Pathian; na sal innchungkhar kong zong hi hmailei caan saupi ca tiangin na rak chim chung cang i hmailei ciruang ding hna zong kha na ka hmuhsak cang, maw Bawipa, Pathian!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun na sal upatnak pek awk caah hin David nih zeidah chim awk ka ngeih ti? Zeicahtiah na sal cu nangmah nih na hngalh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, na sal ruangah le nangmah na lungthin ning tein, hi thil lianngan vialte hngalhternak ah hin hi thil liannganpi hi na tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kannih nih kan hna in kan theihmi vialte ah nangmah bantuk ahohmanh an um lo, maw Bawipa, nangmah hleiah Pathian dang an um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian nih amah mi si awk ca i tlanh awkah a kalhnawh hna i, thil lianngan le thil ṭihnung in nangmah caah min pakhat i ser i Izipt ram chungin na mi hna hmai in miphun hna kha na dawipiakmi na mi Israel mi hna bantuk hi vawlei cungah zei miphun dah a um ti?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun nangmah nih na mi Israel mi hna cu zungzal in na mi si awkah na ser hna i maw Bawipa, nangmah cu an Pathian ah na cang cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun atu cu maw Bawipa, na salpa kong le a innchungkhar kong i na rak chimmi kha zungzal ca in fehter ko law na rak chim bangkhan tuah ko;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />cun ‘Ralkapbu Bawipa, Israel Pathian cu Israel i Pathian a si,’ tiin na min cu zungzal in fehter a si lai i thangṭhat a si lai i na sal David innchungkhar cu na hmaiah fehter a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Zeitintiah nangmah nih maw ka Pathian, na sal cu innchungkhar pakhat kan sakpiak lai tiah ka sinah na phuan cang caah na sal nih hin nangmah hmaiah thla ka cam ngam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun maw Bawipa, nangmah cu Pathian na si i hi thil ṭha cu na sal kha na ka kamh cang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />cucaah na sal innchungkhar hi nangmah hmaiah zungzal in a hmunh nakhnga, thluachuahnak pe ko sawh; zeitintiah maw Bawipa, nangmah nih thluachuah na pek cangmi cu zungzal in thluachuakmi a si ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun mah hnuah cun David nih Filistin mi kha a tei hna i a tangchiah hna i Filistin mi hna kut chung cun Gath le a khuate hna kha a lak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Moab kha a tei, Moab mi hna cu David sal ah an cang i ngunkhuai an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David nih Zufrates tiva i a lungphun bunh awk i a kalpah ah Hamath lei i a ummi Zobah siangpahrang Hadadezer zong kha a tei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun David nih amah sin khan rangleng thong khat, rangcung ralkap thong sarih, le ke ralkap sang hnih a tlaih hna i David nih leng hnuktu rang vialte kha an tha a pheh dih hna, sihmanhsehlaw rangleng za khat ca i a za ding lawnglawng kha a nganh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Damaskas khuami Siria mi nih khan Zobah siangpahrang Hadadezer kha bawmh awkah an rat tikah, David nih khan Siria mi cu sang hnih le thong hnih a rak thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun David nih Damaskas i Siria ah khan ralvengtu ralkapbu a chiah hna i Siria mi cu David sal ah an cang i ngunkhuai kha an pek. Cun Bawipa nih David cu a kalnak kip ah khan teinak a pek lengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Hadadezer sinum hna nih an i putmi sui phaw kha David nih a lak hna i Jerusalem ah a rak phorh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Hadadezer khua a simi Tibaath le Kun in David nih dar tampi a lak; mah cu cun Solomon nih khan dar hmaihum kha le tungpi hna kha le dar umkheng hna kha a ser hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hamath siangpahrang Tou nih, Zobah siangpahrang Hadadezer ralkapbu kha David nih a ning piin a tei dih hna ti kha a theih tikah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hadadezer kha a doh i a tei caah amah cu va biakchawnh awk le va conglawmh awkah Siangpahrang David sinah khan a fapa Hadoram kha a hei thlah; zeitintiah Hadadezer nih khan Tou kha a rak doh lengmang tawn. Cun amah nih cun sui in sermi thilri a phunphun ngun in sermi a phunphun le dar in sermi a phunphun kha a kuat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mah thil hna zong cu Siangpahrang David nih a teimi miphun vialte hna, Edom, Moab, Ammon mi hna, Filistin mi hna le Amalek sinin lakmi sui le ngun hna he khan hmunkhat ah Bawipa sinah a pekchanh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Zeruiah fapa Abishai nih khan Cite Nelrawn ah Edom mi sang khat le thong riat a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Edom ram chungah ralvengtu ralkapbu kha a chiah hna i Edom mi vialte cu David sal ah an cang. Cun Bawipa nih David cu a kalnak kip ah teinak a pek lengmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cucaah David nih Israel mi vialte cu a pen hna i a mi vialte cu biading le ruannak in a uk hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Zeruiah fapa Joab cu ralkapbu haotu bik a si i Ahilud fapa Jehoshafat cu cazin ṭialtu a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />cun Ahitub fapa Zadok le Abiathar fapa Ahimelek cu tlangbawi an si; cun Shavsha cu caṭialtu a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />cun Jehoiada fapa Benaiah cu Khereth mi le Peleth mi hna cung i haotu a si i David fapa hna cu siangpahrang rian ah khuakhangtu upa bik an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun hi hnuah hin Ammon mi hna siangpahrang Nahash kha a thi i a fapa kha amah hmun ah khan a bawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun David nih a thawh i, “Nahash fapa Hanun hi a pa nih ka cungah zumhawktlak tein a rak um caah khan a cungah zumhawktlak tein ka um ve lai,” tiah a ti. Cucaah David nih a pa kong ah khan amah cu va hnemh awkah lamkal a hei thlah hna. Cun David sinum hna cu Hanun sin kha Ammon mi hna ram chungah cun, amah cu va hnemh awkah, an va phan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Ammon mi bawi hna nih khan Hanun cu an thawh i, “David nih nangmah sinah hnemtu a hun thlah hna caah hin na pa kha a upat tiin maw na ruah? A sinum hna nih hin kan ram hi thlokdah awk le tei awk le ngiatthlai awkah na sinah an ra ko lo mei?” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cucaah Hanun nih David sinum hna cu an khahmul a meh hna i an khelbo zawn ah an puan cu a laifang in a tan hna i a kalter hna i an kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun David cu mi hna kong kha an chimh tikah, anmah don awkah mi a hei thlah hna, zeitintiah annih cu an ning a zak ngaingai ko. Cun siangpahrang nih cun, “Nan khahmul a corh ṭhan hlantiang Jeriko khua ah cam ko u, cun nan ra kir ṭhan te lai,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ammon mi hna nih annih cu David huat kan phor cang ti kha an theih tikah, Hanun le Ammon mi hna nih khan Mesopotamia le Aram-maakah le Zobah ram in rangleng hna le rangcung ralkap hna hlan awkah ngun talen thong khat an kuat hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rangleng sang thum thong hnih le Maakah siangpahrang le a ralkapbu, cu an hlan hna i Medeba hmaiah khan an riak. Cun Ammon mi hna cu an khua cio khan an pumh hna i raldohnak hmun ah khan an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mah cucu David nih a theih tikah Joab le a ṭhawngmi ralkapbu vialte kha a thlah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Ammon mi hna cu an ra chuak i khua luhnak ah khan raldoh awkah an i tiang i siangpahrang a rami hna cu anmah tein ramlak ah cun an um ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joab nih hmailei he hnulei he an ka tuk lai ti kha a hmuh tikah, Israel mi chungin thim khunmi kha a thim hna i Siria mi dohtu dingah khan a ningcang tein ṭanhmun a khuarter hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />cun a taang rihmi a mi hna cu a unau Abishai kut tangah a chiah hna i Ammon mi hna dohtu dingah khan a ningcang tein ṭanhmun a khuarter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun anih nih, “Siria mi hi ka caah an ṭhawn tuk ahcun na ka bawmh lai, sihmanhsehlaw Ammon mi hna kha na caah an ṭhawn tuk ah cun kan bawmh ve lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ralṭha ngaiin um tuah, kan mi hna le kan Pathian khua hna caah hin pasal si u sih; cun Bawipa nih a ṭha a tining paoh in tuah ko seh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cucaah Joab le a sin i a ummi hna nih cun tuk awkah Siria mi cu an hei fuh hna i an hmaiah cun an zaam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Ammon mi hna nih Siria mi an zam ti kha an hmuh tikah annih zong, cu bantukin Joab unau Abishai hmai khan an zam ve i khua chungah khan an lut. Cun Joab cu Jerusalem ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Siria mi hna nih Israel mi nih an kan tei ti kha an hmuh tikah, lamkaltu an thlah hna i Zufrates tiva ral ah a ummi Siria mi hna, Hadadezer ralkapbu ralbawi Shofak nih a hruimi hna kha an hun chuahpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mah cucu David kha an chimh tikah Israel mi vialte kha hmunkhat ah a pumh hna i Jordan tiva kha an tan i an sin cu an phan i annih cu tuk awkah a ralkap cu a sersiam hna. Cun David nih Siria mi cu a tuk tik hna ah annih zong nih an tuk ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Siria mi cu Israel mi hna hmai in an zam; cun David nih Siria mi hna chung khan rangleng thong sarih aa citmi hna le ke ralkap sang li a thah hna i an ralkapbu ralbawi Shofak zong kha a thah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun Hadadezer sal hna nih khan Israel mi nih an tei ti kha an hmuh tikah, David he cun remnak an ser i a kut tangmi ah an cang. Cucaah Siria mi nih Ammon mi kha bawmh an duh ti hna lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ṭhal a hung chuak i siangpahrang hna nih raltuknak hmun i an kal tawn caan ah khan, Joab nih ralkapbu kha a kalpi hna i Ammon mi hna ram kha an hrawh i an ra i Rabbah kha an dum. Sihmanhsehlaw David cu Jerusalem ah a um ko. Cun Joab nih Rabbah cu a tuk i a tei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun David nih an siangpahrang bawi luchin cu a lu cung khan a lak; mah cucu talen pakhat a rih kha le a chung i lungvar man sung a um kha a hmuh; cun cucu David kha an chinh. Cun cu khua hranchaw kha a lak, a tam ngaingai ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun a chung i a ummi hna kha a chuah hna i hluah le turung le thir hreitlung in rian a ṭuanter hna; cu bangin Ammon mi hna khua vialte cungah khan a tuah dih. Cun David le a mi vialte cu Jerusalem ah an kir ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun mah hnuah hin Filistin mi he i dohnak Gezer ah a tho ṭhan; Hushath mi Sibbekai nih mingan hna tefa a simi Sippai kha a thah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />cun Filistin mi he i dohnak a um ṭhan hoi; Jair fapa Elhanan nih Git mi Goliath unau Lahmi, a feihlung thiamtlang bantuk a simi cu a thah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Gath ah i dohnak a um ṭhan hoi; cuka ah cun mipa pakhat a pum a ngan ngaingaimi, a kut ah kutdong paruk veve le a ke ah kedong paruk veve, a dihlak ah kul le pali a ngeimi a um i amah zong cu mi ngan hna tefa kha a si ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun amah nih Israel mi kha a hauh hna tikah David u Shimea i fapa Jonathan nih khan a thah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi hna hi Gath khua i a ummi mingan hna hrinthlak kha an si; David kut le a sinum hna kut in an thi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Satan nih Israel mi kha a doh hna i David kha Israel mi cu rel awkah a forh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cucaah David nih cun Joab le ralkapbu haotu hna kha a thawh hna i, “Va kal u law, Israel mi kha Dan in Beersheba tiang va rel hna u, cun zeizat an si kha ka hngalh nakhnga ka chim ṭhan u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Joab nih a thawh i, “ Bawipa nih a mi hna cu atu i nak hin let za khat in chap ko seh! Siangpahrang ka bawipa, annih cu an dihlak tein ka bawipa sal an si ko lo maw? Zeicahdah ka bawipa nih mah hi cu na herh? Zeicahdah Israel mi cungah mawhnak na tlunter lai?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw siangpahrang bia nih Joab cu a tei. Cucaah Joab cu a kal i Israel ram vialte kha a ṭol dih i Jerusalem ah a ra kir ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Joab nih David kha minung a relmi hna a zat cu a pek. Israel ram chung dihlak ah vainam a tlai khomi nuai khat le sing khat an um, cun Judah ram chungah vainam tlai khomi sing li le sang sarih an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw relnak chungah khan Levi mi le Benjamin mi cu a khumh chih hna lo, zeicahtiah a siangpahrang nawl pekmi cu Joab nih khan a duh hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Pathian cu hi thil cungah khan aa lawm lo i Israel mi kha a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun David nih Pathian sinah cun, “Hi thil ka tuahmi ah hin fak piin ka sual cang. Sihmanhsehlaw hruhnak piin ka tuah cang caah na salpa ka ṭhat lonak hi ka hlohpiak ko sawh, tiah kan nawl,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun David ta a simi hmutu Gad kha Bawipa nih a chawnh i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Va kal law David cu, ‘Hi bangin Bawipa nih, “Thil pathum kan pek i pakhat in i thim, cucu na cungah ka tuah lai,’ a ti,” tiah va chim,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cucaah Gad cu David sinah khan a ra i David cu, “ Bawipa nih hi bangin a ti. Na duhmi i thim:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kum thum chung mangṭam maw, asiloah na ral nih nangmah kha thla thum chung hrawh maw, cu chungah cun na ral hna vainam nih nangmah cu an in phanh lai; asiloah Bawipa vainam ni thum chung hrem dik, cucu ram chungah rai tlun le Bawipa vancungmi nih Israel chung dihlak ah rawhnak tuah a si lai,” a ti. Cu Gad nih cun David cu, “A ka thlahtu sinah zei bialehnak dah ka kirpi lai, atu ah bia i khiak tuah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun David nih Gad cu a thawh i, “Harnak nganpi chungah ka um; Bawipa kut cungah cun tla ko ning, zeitintiah anih cu a zaangfahnak a ngan ngaingai; sihmanhsehlaw minung kut chungah cun tla sawh hlah ning,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa nih Israel mi cungah rai kha a tlunter i Israel mi cu sang sarih an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Pathian nih vancungmi cu Jerusalem kha hrawh awkah a thlah; sihmanhsehlaw hrawh hnik a vun zalh ah khin Bawipa nih a hmuh i ṭhat lonak kha Bawipa cu aa ngaichih i hrawktu vancungmi sinah cun, “A za cang, na kut kha ṭhum cang,” tiah a ti. Cun Bawipa vancungmi cu Jebus mi Ornan phuhri pawngah khan a dir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun David nih khua a hun zoh i van le vawlei karah Bawipa vancungmi a dir kha a hmuh, a kut in vainam phawi cia aa put i Jerusalem lei kha a sawh. Khi tikah David le upa hna cu buri an i aih i vawlei ah an bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun David nih Pathian sinah. “Mi kha va rel hna u, tiah nawl petu cu keimah ka si lo mei? Sualnak a tuah i ṭhalo ngaiin a tuahtu cu keimah ka si. Sihmanhsehlaw hi tuu hna nih hin zeidah an tuah? Maw Bawipa, ka Pathian, na kut cu keimah le ka pa innchungkhar cungah si ko seh, rai cu na mi hna cungah tlung sawh hlah seh, tiah kan nawl,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Bawipa vancungmi nih Gad cu, David kha hung kal seh law Jebus mi Ornan phuhri ah Bawipa caah biakṭheng pakhat in hung ser seh, tiin David cu chimh awkah nawl a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cucaah Bawipa min in Gad nih a chimmi bia bangin David cu a hung kal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ornan cu changvut kha a rak cil len ko; aa mer i vancungmi kha a hmuh i amah sin i a ummi a fapa pali hna kha an i thup.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />David cu Ornan sin lei i a rat lioah khan. Ornan nih cun a hei zoh i David kha a hmuh i phuhri cun a va chuak i vawlei lei hoih in David cu upatnak kha a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun David nih Ornan cu a thawh i, “Rai hi mi sinin a kian nakhnga, Bawipa sin i biakṭheng saknak caah phuhri hmun hi ka pe tuah — a man tling tein ka hau ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun Ornan nih David cu, “I lak tuah; cun siangpahrang ka bawipa nih a ṭha a timi paoh kha tuah ko seh; zohhmanh cawtum hna cu khangh thawinak caah, cun rawl velhnak fung hna cu thing caah, cun changvut cu changvut thawinak caah kan pek. A dihlak in kan pek dih,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Siangpahrang David nih Ornan cu, “Asilo, a man tling tein kan cawk ko lai; Bawipa caah nangmah ta a simi cu ka la lai lo i a man zeihmanh ka liam lomi khangh thawinak zong ka pechan lai lo,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cucaah David nih Ornan cu cu hmun caah cun sui shekel za ruk a thlai i a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun khika ah David nih Bawipa caah biakṭheng a ser i khangh thawinak le daihnak thawinak hna kha a pekchanh hna i Bawipa kha a auh i amah nih cun khangh thawinak biakṭheng cung i vancung in a tlami mei khan amah cu a leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih vancungmi kha nawl a pek i a vainam cu a kawng chungah a sawh ṭhan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Khi caan ah khan, Jebus mi Ornan phuhri ah Bawipa nih a ka leh tiah David nih a hmuh tikah, khika ah a raithawinak hna kha a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Zeitintiah ramlak ah Moses nih a sermi Bawipa puan biakinn le khangh thawinak biakṭheng hna cu khi caan ah khan Gibeon i khuahrum bo ah khan an um ko;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />sihmanhsehlaw David cu Bawipa kha va hal awkah a hmaiah cun a kal kho lo; zeicahtiah Bawipa vancungmi vainam kha a ṭih.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun David nih, “Hika ah hin Bawipa Pathian inn cu a si lai i hika ah hin Israel mi ca i khangh thawinak biakṭheng cu a si lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David nih Israel ram chung i ramdangmi a ummi hna kha i pumh awkah nawl a pek hna i Bawipa inn saknak caah lung attu hna kha lung a remhter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David nih kutka innka hna le kapza hna khenhnak thir caah khan thir tampi a rak chiah, cun dar cu thlai cawk loin a chiah i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />sidar thingah cu rel cawk loin a chiah; zeitintiah Sidon mi le Tair mi nih sidar thing tampi David sinah khan an rak phorh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun David nih a thawh i, “Ka fapa Solomon hi a ngakchia i zeihmanh a hngal rih lo, cun Bawipa ca i sak dingmi inn cu rumra a um hringhranmi, a minthannak le a sunparnak ram vialte ah a thangmi a si awk a si; cucaah ka rak timhlamh chung lai,” tiah a ti. Cucaah David nih a thih hlanah thilri tampi a damhtak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun a fapa Solomon cu a auh i Bawipa, Israel Pathian ca i inn sak cu a cungah a hluai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David nih Solomon cu a thawh i, “Ka fapa, Bawipa ka Pathian min thangṭhatnak ca i inn sak cu ka lung chungin ka rak i ruahchihmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Bawipa bia cu ka sinah a ra i, ‘Thisen tampi na chuah i ral ngan kha na doh hna; keimah hmaiah vawlei cungah thisen tampi na chuah caah ka min thangṭhatnak caah inn na sa lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zohhmanh, fapa pakhat na hrin lai; amah cu daihnak mi a si lai. Amah cu a velchum i a ummi ral vialte hna lakin daihnak ka pek lai; zeitintiah a min cu Solomon a si lai i amah chan chungah cun Israel mi cu daihnak le remnak ka pek hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah nih cun ka min caah inn pakhat a sak lai. Amah cu ka fapa a si lai i keimah cu a pa ka si lai i a siangpahrang bawiṭhutdan cu Israel chungah zungzal in ka fehter lai,’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cucaah ka fapa, nangmah kong ah a chimmi bia bangin Bawipa na Pathian ca i inn saknak ah cun na hlawhtlin nakhnga, Bawipa cu na sinah um ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangmah cu Israel mi zohkhenh awk ṭuanvo kha an pek tikah Bawipa na Pathian phungbia cu na zulh nakhnga, Bawipa nih fimnak le hngalhthiamnak in pe ko seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khi tikah Bawipa nih Moses cu Israel mi caah a pekmi phunglam le nawlbia hna kha ṭha tein na zulh hna ahcun, na hlawh a tling lai. Ṭhawng ngai le ralṭha in um tuah. Ṭih hlah; na lung dong hlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Har ngaiin Bawipa inn caah cun sui talen sing za khat, ngun talen nuai khat, dar le thir cu thlai cawk lo ka timh cang, a tam hringhran ko; thingah le lung zong ka timh cang. Mah vialte ah hin na chap awk a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rianṭuantu tlamtling tein na ngei ko: lung attu, lung remhtu, inn sak thiam, zungthiam a phunphun rel cawk lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />sui siseh, ngun siseh, dar siseh thir siseh ser a thiammi na ngei ko hna. Tho law ṭuan colh ko! Bawipa cu na sinah um ko seh!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David nih Israel mi haotu vialte zong kha a fapa Solomon cu bawmh awkah nawl a pek hna i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“ Bawipa nan Pathian cu nan sinah a um lo mei? Cun amah nih kam kip ah daihnak an pe hna lo mei? Zeitintiah hi ram chung i a ummi hna cu nan kut chungah an pek hna i ram cu Bawipa le a mi hna hmaiah tei a si cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Atu cu Bawipa nan Pathian kha nan ruahnak le nan lungthin in biatak tein kawl tuah u. Bawipa biakamnak kuang le Pathian umkheng thiang hna cu Bawipa min ca i sakmi inn chungah khan luhpi an si nakhnga, tho u law Bawipa Pathian i hmunthiang cu sa tuah u,” tiah a ti hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun David cu a upa i a tar ngaingai tikah a fapa Solomon cu Israel mi siangpahrang ah a ser.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David nih Israel mi haotu vialte tlangbawi hna le Levi mi hna kha a pumh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Levi mi cu, kum sawm thum a timi le a cunglei kha an rel hna i an dihlak ah sang thum le thong riat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David nih, “Hi hna chung hin sang hnih le thong li nih Bawipa innchung rianṭuan kha an ṭuanvo a si lai i thong ruk cu biaceihtu le bawi an si lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />thong li cu kutka cawngtu an si lai i thangṭhatnak caah ka sermi hlasaknak thilri in thong li nih Bawipa kha thangṭhatnak an pek lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun annih cu David nih Levi fapa Gershom, Kohath le Merari hna ning khan an bu an bu cio in a ṭhen hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gershom fapa hna cu Ladan le Shimei an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ladan fapa hna: haotu bik Jehiel, le Zetham le Joel, pathum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Shimei fapa hna: Shelomoth, Haziel, le Haran, pathum an si. Mah hna hi Ladan innchungkhar hna lu cio kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Shimei fapa hna: Jahath, Zina le Jeush le Beriah. Hi pali hna hi Shimei fapa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Haotu bik cu Jahath a si i a hun changtu cu Zizah a si; sihmanhsehlaw Jeush le Beriah cu fapa tampi an ngei lo, cucaah voi khat relnak ah pa pakhat i innchungkhar ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kohath fapa hna: Amram, Izhar, Hebron, le Uzziel, pali an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amram fapa hna: Aaron le Moses. Aaron cu amah le a fapa hna nih zungzal in Bawipa hmaiah zihmui kha an khangh i amah rian kha an ṭuan i amah min in zungzal in thluachuah peknak an chim nakhnga, Aaron cu a thiang bikmi thil hna kha pekchanh awkah thleidan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Pathian mi Moses i a fapa hna kha cu Levi mi phun chungah khan rel an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses fapa hna: Gershom le Eliezer.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gershom fapa hna: haotu bik Shebuel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Eliezer fapa hna: haotu bik Rehabiah; Eliezer nih fapa dang a ngei hna lo, sihmanhsehlaw Rehabiah fapa cu an tam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Izhar fapa hna: haotu bik Shelomith, pahnihnak ah Amariah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />pathumnak ah Jahaziel, palinak ah Jekameam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Uzziel fapa hna: haotu bik Mikah le a pahnihnak Isshiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Merari fapa hna: Mahli le Mushi. Mahli fapa hna: Eleazar le Kish.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eleazar cu fapa hring loin a thi, fanu lawnglawng a ngeih hna; an rualchan Kish fapa hna nih khan an ṭhit hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mushi fapa hna: Mahli, Eder le Jeremoth, pathum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mah hna hi Levi fapa hna, an pale chungkhar ning cio ah an si; annih cu an pa le chungkhar hna lu cio, Bawipa inn rian kha ṭuan awkah, min thlak a simi kum kul ri in a cunglei hna kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cucaah David nih hi bangin “ Bawipa, Israel Pathian nih a mi cu daihnak a pek cang hna; cun Jerusalem ah zungzal in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cucaah Levi mi hna nih puan biakinn kha siseh, a chung rianṭuannak ca i thilthuam si hna seh, an phorh a herh ti lo,” a ti;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />zeitintiah David bia a hmanung bik bangin, Levi mi kum kul ri in a cunglei hna cu mah zat hi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Sihmanhsehlaw annih an rian cu Bawipa inn rianṭuannak i Aaron fapa hna bawmh kha a si lai, annih nih tual hna le innchung dal hna kha an zohkhenh lai, a thiangmi thil vialte kha an thianhhlimh lai. Pathian inn chung rian zeipaoh kha an ṭuan lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />cun hun camcinmi changreu le changvut thawinak ca i changvut le thilnu cawh lo changreu pan tete hna le rawhmi changreu thawinak le chiti he cawhmi thawinak hna timhtuahnak le a tam a tlawm lei tahnak ah siseh, a hmet a ngan lei tahnak ah siseh, annih nih an bawmh fawn hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cun zing fate in an dir lai i Bawipa kha an lawmh lai i an thangṭhat lai, cu bantuk ṭhiamṭhiam in zanlei zongah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />cun Bawipa sinah khangh thawinak hna kha sabbath ni ah siseh, thla thar ah siseh, puai ni ah siseh, cu zat in nan tuah awk a si tining khan Bawipa hmaiah pekchanh camcin a si fate annih nih cu bantuk ṭhiamṭhiam in an tuah lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuticun annih nih tonnak thlam le hmunthiang kha an zohkhenh hna lai i Bawipa inn rian ṭuannak ah khan an unau Aaron fapa hna kha an bawmh hna lai.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aaron fapa hna an i ṭhenning cu hi bangin a si. Aaron fapa hna: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar le Ithamar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Nadab le Abihud cu an pa hlanah an thi i fa an ngei lo cucaah Eleazar le Ithamar cu tlangbawi an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eleazar fapa hna chung i Zadok le Ithamar fapa hna chung i Ahimelek bawmhnak thawngin, David nih an rian ṭuan awkah an thiah ning hna bantuk khan rian a phawt hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eleazar fapa hna lakah Ithamar fapa hna chung nakin mi upa an tam deuh caah Eleazar fapa hna chung cun innchungkhar haotu hleiruk an chiah hna i Ithamar fapa hna chungin pariat an chiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Annih cu an dihlak in aa lo cio ah, camcawhfung khiah in phawt an si, zeicahtiah Eleazar fapa hna le Ithamar fapa hna chungah khan Biakinn lei haotu hna le thlarau lei haotu hna kha an um veve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Levi mi Nethanel fapa Shemaiah, caṭialtu, nih khan, siangpahrang le bawi hna le tlangbawi Zadok le Abiathar fapa Ahimelek le tlangbawi hna le Levi mi hna chungkhar hna lu hna hmaika ah khan, cazin ah a khumh hna; Eleazar caah khan innchungkhar pakhat cu thim a si i Ithamar caah khan pakhat thim a si ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Camcawhfung hmasa bik cu Jehoiarib cungah a tla, pahnihnak cu Jedaiah cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />pathumnak cu Harim cungah a tla, palinak cu Seorim cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />panganak cu Malkhijah cungah a tla, paruknak cu Mijamin cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />pasarihnak cu Hakkoz cungah a tla, pariatnak cu Abijah cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />pakuanak cu Jeshua cungah a tla, pahranak cu Shekhaniah cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />hleikhatnak cu Eliashib cungah a tla, hleihnihnak cu Jakim cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />hleithumnak cu Huppah cungah a tla, hleilinak cu Jeshebeab cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hleinganak cu Bilgah cungah a tla, hleiruknak cu Immer cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hleisarihnak cu Hezir cungah a tla, hleiriatnak cu Happiz-zez cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hleikuanak cu Pethahiah cungah a tla, pakulnak cu Jehezkel cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />kul khatnak, cu Jakhin cungah a tla, kul hnihnak cu Gamul cungah a tla,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />kul thumnak cu Delaiah cungah a tla, kul linak cu Maaziah cungah a tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa Israel Pathian nih nawl a pek bangin an pa Aaron nih an caah rianṭuan ningcang a rak chiahpiakmi hna ning khan, hi hna nih hin Bawipa inn chung i luh cu an rianṭuannak chung i thiahmi rian ah khan an i ngeih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Levi fapa a tang rihmi hna kha cu: Amram fapa hna lakah khan Shubael a si; Shubael fapa hna lakah khan Jehdeiah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehabiah leiah cun: Rehabiah fapa hna lakah an haotu bik Isshiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Izhar mi hna lakah, Shelomoth; Shelomoth fapa hna lakah Jahath.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hebron fapa hna: an haotu bik Jeriah, a hun dottu Amariah, a pathumnak Zahaziel, a palinak, Jekameam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Uzziel fapa hna lakah Mikah; Mikah fapa hna lakah Shamir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mikah unau cu Isshiah a si; Isshiah fapa hna lakah Jekhariah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Merari fapa hna: Mahli le Mushi. Jaaziah fapa hna: Beno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Merari fapa hna: Jaaziah fapa ah Beno, Shoham, Zakkur le Ibri.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Mahli fapa ah: Eleazar a si, fapa a ngei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kish leiah, Kish fapa hna Jerahmeel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mushi fapa hna: Mahli, Eder le Jerimoth. Mah hna hi Levi mi fapa hna, an pale innchungkhar ning cio in an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Siangpahrang David, Zadok, Ahimelek le tlangbawi hna le Levi mi hna an pale innchungkhar lu cio hna hmaiah Aaron fapa an unau hna nih an tuah bang khan, pale innchungkhar i lu a si ciomi hna le an nau le cio nih khan, camcawhfung cu an zuh ve.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David le rianṭuannak i upa bikbik hna nih cun rianṭuannak ca dingah khan Asaf fapa hna le Heman fapa hna le Jeduthun fapa hna lak khan tingtang le thonglawi le sumsel hna he bia a chimtu dingah mi kha an thleidan hna. Cu rian a ṭuantu hna le an rian cazin cu mah hihi a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asaf fapa hna lakin: Zakkur, Josef, Nethaniah, le Ashrelah; annih cu Asaf fapa Asaf nih a hruaimi hna, siangpahrang nih a chimh hna ning bangin bia a chimmi kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeduthun chung cun, Jeduthun fapa hna: Gedaliah, Zeri, Jeshaiah, Shimei, Hashabiah, le Mattithiah, paruk an si, an pa Jeduthun nih a hruai hna i Bawipa lawmhnak le thangṭhatnak ah tingtang he annih nih bia an chim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Heman chung cun, Heman fapa hna: Bukkiah, Mattaniah, Uzziel, Shebuel, le Jerimoth, Hananiah, Hanani, Eliathah, Giddalti, le Romamtiezer, Joshbekashah, Mallothi, Hothir, Mahazioth an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mah vialte hi Pathian nih Heman cu kan hlorh lai tiah bia a kam ningin Heman siangpahrang hmutu i a fapa hna cu an si; zeitintiah Pathian nih Heman cu fapa hleili le fanu pathum a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Annih cu an dihlak in an pa nih a hruai hna i Bawipa inn chung i sumsel le tingtang le thonglawi he tiah Bawipa inn chung i rianṭuannak ah khan awdawh satu an si. Asaf, Jeduthun le Heman tu cu siangpahrang nawl tangah khan an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Annih cu an unaule, Bawipa thangṭhatnak hlasak i cawnpiakmi, a thiammi vialte he, za hnih sawm riat pariat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun annih nih a hme a ngan in, cawnpiaktu he cawnpiakmi he, aa khat rep in, an rian caah khan camcawhfung an zuh cio.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asaf ca i camcawhfung hmasa bik cu Josef cungah a tla; a pahnihnak cu Gedaliah le a unau hna le a fapa hna, pahleihnih hna cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />pathumnak cu Zakkur le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />palinak cu Izri le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />panganak cu Nethaniah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />paruknak cu Bukkiah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />pasarihnak cu Jesharelah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />pariatnak cu Jeshaiah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />pakuanak cu Mattaniah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />pahranak cu Shimei le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />hleikhatnak cu Azarel le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hleihnihnak cu Hashabiah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />hleithumnak ah cun Shubael le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a hleilinak cu, Mattithiah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />hleinganak cu, Jeremoth le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />hleiruknak ah cun, Hananiah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />hleisarihnak ah cun, Joshbekashah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />hleiriatnak ah cun, Hanani le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />hleikuanak ah cun, Mallothi le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />pakulnak ah cun, Eliathah le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />kul khatnak ah cun, Hothir le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />kul hnihnak ah cun, Giddalti le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />kul thumnak ah cun, Mahazioth le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />kul linak ah cun, Romamtiezer le a fapa hna le a unau hna, hleihnih cungah a tla.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kutka cawngtu pawl an i phawtning cu hi bangin a si: Korah mi hna chungin, Meshelemiah; amah cu Kore fapa a si, Kore cu Asaf fapa hna lak i pakhat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Meshelemiah nih fapa a ngeih hna: a fater cu Jekhariah a si, pahnihnak cu Jediael a si, pathumnak cu Zebadiah a si, palinak cu Jathniel a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />panganak cu Elam a si, paruknak cu Jehohanan a si, pasarihnak cu Elie-ho-enai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Obededom nih fapa a ngeih hna: a fater cu Shemaiah, a pahnihnak cu Jehozabad, pathumnak cu Joah, palinak cu Sakar, panganak cu Nethanel,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />paruknak cu Ammiel, pasarihnak cu Issakhar, pariatnak cu Peullethai a si; zeitintiah Pathian nih thluachuahnak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A fapa Shemaiah zong nih khan an pale innchungkhar i uktu a si ciomi fapa hna kha a hrin hna, zeitintiah annih cu thil ti kho ngaimi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Shemaiah fapa hna cu: Othni, Refael, Obed le Elzabad an si, an unau hna cu miṭhawng Elihu le Semakhiah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi vialte hi an fapa hna le an unau hna he Obededom fapa cu an si, annih cu mi thil ti kho, rianṭuannak ca i a tlingmi an si; Obededom tefa cu sawm ruk le pahnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Meshelemiah nih fapa hna le unau hna a ngeih hna, mi thil ti kho an si, hleiriat an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Merari fapa hna lak i Hosah nih khan fapa a ngeih hna: upa bik ah Shimri, (amah cu fater a si lo nain a pa nih upa bik ah a ser),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />pahnihnak ah Hilkiah, pathumnak ah Tebaliah, palinak ah Zekhariah; Hosah fapa hna le a unau hna cu an dihlak ah hleithum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kutka cawngtu pawl an ṭhenmi hna nih hin, an upa bikbik hna zat khan, an unau hna nih Bawipa inn chung i rian an ngeih bantuk te khan annih zong nih rian an ngei ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun an kutka hna caah khan, a hme a ngan aa khat tein, an pale innchungkhar ning cio khan camcawhfung an zuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nichuahlei ca i camcawhfung cu Shelemiah cungah a tla. Cun a fapa Zekhariah, fimchimtu a fim ngaingaimi caah khan camcawh fung an zuh i a camcawhfung cu chaklei caah khan a chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Obededom camcawh fung cu thlanglei caah a chuak i a fapa hna cu thilchiahnak inn zohkhenh rian nih khan a kiah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shuppim le Hosah kha nitlaklei nih a kiah hna, cucu a hung kaimi lam i a ummi Shallekheth kutka ah khan a si. An cawnghning cu aa khat cio.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nifate in nichuahlei ah cun paruk lengmang an um, chaklei ah cun nifate in pali lengmang, thlanglei ah cun ni fate in pali lengmang, cun thil chiahnak inn ah khan pahnih veve;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />cun nitlaklei i a ummi a innte caah khan, lam ah pali, cun a innte ah pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mah hihi Korah mi hna le Merari fapa hna lak i kutka cawngtu hna an i ṭhenning cu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Levi mi hna lak khan, Ahijah nih khan Pathian inn chawhlawn kuang le pekchanhmi laksawng chawhlawn kuang kha a zohkhenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ladan fapa hna, Ladan ta a simi Gershon mi fapa hna, Gershon mi a simi Ladan ta a simi an pale innchungkhar lu Jehieli.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehieli fapa Zetham le a unau Joel cu Bawipa inn chawhlawn kuang hna kha a zohkhenhtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amram mi hna le Izhar mi hna le Hebron mi hna le Uzziel mi hna chung cun
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses fapa Gershom i fapa Shebuel cu chawhlawn kuang zohkhenhtu bawi ngan bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A unau hna cu: Eliezer chungin a chuakmi a fapa Rehabiah le a fapa Jeshaiah le a fapa Joram le a fapa Zikhri le a fapa Shelomoth an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hi Shelomoth le a unau hna hi, siangpahrang David le an pale innchungkhar hna lu cio le a thong pawl haotu hna le a za pawl haotu hna le ralkapbu ralbawi hna nih pekchanhmi laksawng, an pekchanhmi chawhlawn vialte kha a zohkhenhtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Raltuknak hmun i an teimi hranchaw chung khan Bawipa inn zohkhenhnak caah laksawng kha an pekchanh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun hmutu Samuel le Kish fapa Saul le Ner fapa Abner le Zeruiah fapa Joab nih an pekchanhmi thil vialte — pekchanhmi laksawng vialte hna cu Shelomoth le a unau hna nih an kilven hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Izhar mi hna chungin, Khenaniah le a fapa hna cu Israel ram a lenglei rian ah, bawi hna le biaceihtu hna ah thiah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hebron mi hna chungin, Hashabiah le a unau hna, mi thong khat le za sarih, thil ti kho ngaimi hna cu, Israel ram chung Jordan tiva in nitlaklei kha, Bawipa rian vialte ca le siangpahrang rian dihlak kha a zohkhenhtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron mi hna chungah cun, an ciruang zei bantuk khum a si le an pale innchungkhar zei bantuk khum a si ah, Jerijah cu Hebron mi hna an upa bik a si. (David a bawi kum sawm linak kum ah mi kha an kawl hna i Gilead ram Jazer khua ah thil ti kho ngaingaimi kha an hmuh hna).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Siangpahrang David nih amah le a unau hna, thil ti kho ngaimi mi thong hnih le za sarih, an pale chungkhar i lu cio a simi hna kha, Reuben mi hna le Gad mi hna le Manasseh phun cheumi hna cung i Pathian lei le siangpahrang rian he aa pehtlaimi zeizong vialte kongah, zohkhenhtu ah a chiah hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mah hihi Israel mi, an pale innchungkhar hna lu a si ciomi, a thongthong pawl a uktu hna le a zaza pawl a uktu hna le an bawi pawl hna, a chuak a lut lengmangmi bu pipi hna he aa pehtlaimi rian i thla khat hnu thla khat in kum chuak tiang siangpahrang cu a rian a ṭuanpiaktu hna cazin cu a si, bu khat cu sang hnih thong li an si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zabdiel fapa Jashobeam cu thla khatnak thla ah pakhatnak bu kha a hruitu a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah cu Perez tefa a si i thla khatnak thla ah cun amah cu ralkapbu haotu vialte hna bawi bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thla hnihnak thla bu cu Aho mi Dodai nih a hrui hna; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ralbawi pathumnak, thla thumnak thla ca i cu Benaiah a si, amah cu tlangbawi Jehoiada fapa a si i haotu bik a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi Benaiah hi sawm thum hna lak i miṭhawng kha a si i amah nih sawm thum hna kha a hrui hna; amah bu a haotu hna cu a fapa Ammizabad kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thla linak ca i a palinak cu Joab unau Asahel kha a si i a fapa Zebadiah nih khan a hun zulh; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ralbawi panganak, thla nganak ca i cu Izrah mi Shamhuth a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Paruknak, thla ruknak ca i cu Ira a si, amah cu Tekoa mi Ikkesh fapa a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasarihnak, thla sarihnak ca i cu Efraim tefa Pelon mi Helez a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pariatnak, thla riatnak ca i cu Zerah tefa Hushath mi Sibbekai a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pakuanak, thla kuanak ca i cu Benjamin tefa Anathoth mi Abiezer a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pahranak, thla hranak ca i cu Zerah tefa Netofah mi Maharai a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hleikhatnak, thla hleikhatnak ca i cu Benjamin fapa hna tefa Pirathon mi Benaiah a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hleihnihnak, thla hleihnihnak ca i cu Othniel tefa Netofah mi Heldai a si; a bu chungah cun sang hnih le thong li an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel mi phun hna chungah cun, Reuben mi hna caah Zikhri fapa Eliezer cu bawi upa bik a si; Simeon mi hna caah Maakah fapa Shefatiah a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Levi caah Kemuel fapa Hashabiah a si; Aaron caah Zadok a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah caah Elihu a si, amah cu David unau pakhat a si; Issakhar caah Mikhael fapa Omri a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zebulun caah Obadiah fapa Ishmaiah a si; Naftali caah Azriel fapa Jeremoth a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Efraim mi hna caah Azaziah fapa Hoshea a si; Manasseh phun cheu caah Pedaiah fapa Joel a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gilead i a ummi Manasseh phun cheu caah Zekhariah fapa Iddo a si; Benjamin caah Abner fapa Jaasiel a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan caah Jehoram fapa Azarel a si. Mah hna hi Israel mi phun a hruitu hna cu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />David nih kum kul toi kha cu a rel hna lo, zeicahtiah Bawipa nih Israel cu van i arfi zat ah khin ka ser lai tiah bia a kam cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zeruiah fapa Joab nih khan rel hram a thawk, sihmanhsehlaw a dih lo; asinain hi ruang ah hin Israel cungah thinhunnak a tlung i cu relnak cu Siangpahrang David chanrelnak chungah khumh a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siangpahrang chawhlawn kuang hna a zohkhenhtu cu Adiel fapa Azmaveth a si; cun ram chung i a ummi le khua chung i a ummi le khuate chung le innsang chung i a ummi chawhlawn kuang hna a zohkhenhtu cu Uzziah fapa Jonathan a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vawlei kha leh awkah lo chung i rian a ṭuantu hna a zohkhenhtu cu Khelub fapa Ezri a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />mitsur dum a zohkhenhtu cu Ramath mi Shimei a si; cun mitsur dum chungin a chuakmi mitsur hang khonnak zohkhenhtu cu Shifmot mi Zabdi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Shefelah i a ummi oliv thing le saikamor thing zohkhenhtu cu Geder mi Baalhanan a si; cun chiti khonmi a zohkhenhtu cu Joash a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sharon i a tlongmi saṭil run a zohkhenhtu hna cu Sharon mi Shitrai a si; nelrawn i a tlongmi saṭil run zohkhenhtu hna cu Adlai fapa Shafat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kalauk a zohkhenhtu hna cu Ishmael mi Obil a si; laa a nu a zohkhenhtu hna cu Meronoth mi Jehdeiah a si. Tuurun a zohkhenhtu hna cu Hag mi Jaziz a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi vialte hna hi David Siangpahrang chaw kengtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David pacheu Jonathan cu fimchimtu a si, amah cu mifim le cazi a si; amah le Hakhmoni fapa Jehiel nih siangpahrang fapa kha an zohkhenh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahithophel cu siangpahrang fimchimtu a si i Arki mi Hushai cu siangpahrang hawikom a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahithophel cu Jehoiada, Benaiah fapa le Abiathar nih an hun chaan. Joab cu siangpahrang ralkapbu haotu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nih Jerusalem ah Israel mi bawi vialte, an phun chung bawi hna, siangpahrang rian a ṭuanmi ralkapbu bawi hna, a thongthong pawl a haotu hna, a zaza pawl a haotu hna, siangpahrang le a fapa hna i an thilri le saṭil a cawngtu hna kha siangpahrang inn bawi hna le miṭhawng hna le ralkap ṭhawng vialte hna he khan hmunkhat ah a pumh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Siangpahrang David cu a dir i, “Ka unau hna le ka mi hna, ka bia ka ngai tuah u. Bawipa biakamnak kuang caah le kan Pathian ke chiahnak caah dinhnak inn pakhat kha sa ning law tiah ka lung chungin ka rak ti tawnmi a si i cu saknak caah cun timhtuahnak ka rak ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Pathian nih a ka thawh i, ‘Nang nih cun ka min caah inn na sa hnga lo, zeicahtiah nang cu ralkap na si i thisen na chuah,’ tiah a ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain, Bawipa, Israel Pathian nih keimah cu ka pa innchungkhar vialte chung khan Israel cung i siangpahrang zungzal in si awkah a ka thim; zeitintiah Judah kha hruaitu ah a thim i Judah innchungkhar chungah ka pa innchungkhar kha a thim i ka pa fapa hna lakah keimah cu Israel mi vialte cung i siangpahrang ah ser awkah ka chungah lawmhnak a ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun ka fapa vialte hna lakah (zeitintiah Bawipa nih fapa tampi a ka pek hna) ka fapa Solomon cu Israel cung i Bawipa pennak bawiṭhutdan cung i ṭhut awkah khan a thim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah nih a ka thawh i, ‘Ka inn le ka tual a satu ding cu na fapa Solomon hi a si lai, zeitintiah amah cu ka fapa si awkah ka thim cang i keimah cu a pa ka si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nihin ah a tuah bantuk hin, ka nawlbia hna le ka phunglam hna kha fek tein a zulh lengmang hna ahcun, a pennak cu zungzal in ka hmunhter lai,’ tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cucaah Israel mi vialte, Bawipa mibu aa pummi hmuhhngan le kan Pathian theihhngan ah hin, nannih nih Bawipa nan Pathian i nawlbia vialte cu zul u law kawl tuah u; zeitintiah nannih nih hi ram ṭha cu nan co i nan hnu i a ra dingmi nan tefa hna caah ro ah nan roh zungzal hna nakhnga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Cun nang, Solomon ka fapa, na pa i a Pathian hi hngal law lung ṭengnge lo te le a tha a thomi ruahnak he a rian ṭuan tuah; zeitintiah Bawipa nih cun lung vialte cu a purh dih ko i tinhmi le ruahnak vialte cu a hngalh dih. Amah cu na kawl ahcun na hmuh lai; sihmanhsehlaw amah cu na hlawt ahcun zungzal in an hlonh ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cucaah i ralring tuah, zeicahtiah nangmah cu Bawipa nih a thiangmi hmun ca i inn sak awkah an thim cang; ṭhawng ngaiin um law ṭuan tuah,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khi tikah David nih a fapa Solomon cu biakinn a tual le a inn hna le a chawhlawn chiahnak hna le a cunglei khaan hna le a chungchin dal hna ruam-am le velngeihnak ṭhutdan chiahnak a khaan ca i a ruam-am cu a pek;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />cun Bawipa inntual ca le a kulhtu khaan hna le Pathian inn chawhlawn khonnak hna le pekchanhmi laksawng chawhlawn khonnak ding ruam-am hna zong kha a pek;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />cun tlangbawi hna le Levi mi hna a phu a phu in an umnak ding le Bawipa inn chung rianṭuannak ca rian vialte; Bawipa inn chung rianṭuannak ca i umkheng vialte ca le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />rianṭuannak cio ca i sui umkheng hna ca i sui a rih zat rianṭuannak cio ca i a herhmi ngun a rih zat,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />sui meivannak tung hna le an meiinn hna an rihning, meivannak tung pakhat cio ca le a meiinn hna ca i a herhmi sui a rihning, meivannak tung ca le a meiinn hna ca i a herhmi ngun a rihning, rianṭuannak ca i a meivannak tung hna cu hman an sining cio in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />hun camcinmi changreu cabuai cio hna ca i a herhmi sui a rihning, ngun cabuai ca i ngun a herhmi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />keuṭe ca le hmaihum ca le hrai ca i a herhmi sui thiang; sui khengkuar hna le an rihning cio,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ermi sui in an sermi rimhmui biakṭheng ca le a rihning i an ruam-am vialte a lung chung i aa chiahmi cu a pek; cun sui rangleng le an thla aa samh i Bawipa biakamnak kuang a zarhtu cherubim hna ca i a ruahmi an ruam-am zong kha a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun David nih aa thawh i, “ Bawipa hrimhrim nih na tuah lai, tiah a ka fialmi tuahnak ding caah a ṭial in ṭialmi timhtuahnak chungah hi thil vialte hi an um dih,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khi tikah David nih a fapa Solomon cu a thawh i, “Ṭhawng ngai le ralṭha ngaiin um law ṭuan tuah. Ṭih hlah, na lung dong hlah; zeicahtiah Bawipa Pathian, keimah i ka Pathian hrimhrim cu na sinah a um. Bawipa inn chung rianṭuannak ca i rian vialte cu lim a si hlantiang amah nih cun an deuh lai lo i an hlaw fawn lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Pathian inn rianṭuannak vialte ca i tlangbawi bu hna le Levi mibu hna hi zoh tuah hna; cun hi rian vialte ah hin zungthiammi paoh nih anmah le an thiamnak zawn rian paoh ah khan an in ṭanpi lai i bawi hna le mi vialte hna zong hi nangmah nawl tangah an um dih lai,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Siangpahrang David nih aa pummi cu a thawh hna i, “Ka fapa Solomon hi Pathian nih a timhmi cu a si. Asinain amah cu a no rih i a hmuhtonmi a tlawm; sihmanhsehlaw ṭuan ding vial cu rian nganpi a si ṭung, zeicahtiah sak ding inn hi minung ca siangpahrang inn a si lo i Bawipa Pathian ca a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cucaah kan Pathian biakinn ca thilri cu ka ti khawh chungin ka damh hna. Sui thilri ca sui, ngun thilri ca ngun, dar thilri ca dar, thir thilri ca thir, thing thilri ca thing kha ka damh hna. Cuhleiah, ṭamhnak caah oniks lungvar tampi le lung tampi, cun antimoni lungvar, lung a mui a phunphun a simi hna, lung mansung a phunphun le marbal lung kha tampi ka damh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi vialte hleiah hin keimah pumpak ta chungin sui le ngun kha kan Pathian inn ka ṭanh caah Pathian biakinn caah cun ka thawh hna:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />vampang nalhnak caah sui talen thong thum, Ofir sui dakmak, er ciami ngun talen thong sarih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />cun zungthiam hna tuah awk a simi caah sui thilri caah sui, ngun thilri caah ngun kha ka thawh hna. Cucaah nihin ah hin Bawipa sinah mah le mah i pekchanh in lungtho tein ahodah siannak in a tho vemi nan si lai?” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun pale hna innchungkhar lu cio nih khan mah lungtho tein an thawhlawm cu an thawh hna i phun hruitu hna le a thongthong pawl haotu hna le a zaza pawl haotu hna le siangpahrang rian i bawi hna zong nih khan mah bantuk cun an tuah ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian inn ca rianṭuannak caah cun sui talen thong nga le darik thong hra, ngun talen thong hra, dar talen thong hleiriat, thir talen sing khat an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun lung mansung a ngeimi paoh nih khan Bawipa inn chawhlawn khonnak ah cun an lungvar kha an pek i mah cucu Gershon mi Jehiel nih khan a zohkhenh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun mi cu an i lawm, zeicahtiah lungtho tein an pek, lung ṭengnge lo tein thawhlawm cu Bawipa sinah an pek i tampi an pek; siangpahrang David zong aa lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cucaah David nih Bawipa cu aa pummi vialte hmaiah cun a thangṭhat i David nih cun, “Maw Bawipa, kan pu Israel i Pathian, nangmah cu zungzal thluangthluan in thangṭhat na si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, lianhngannak le ṭhawnnak le sunparnak le teinak le upatnak cu nangmah ta an si ko; zeitintiah vancung le vawlei cung i a ummi thil vialte cu nangmah ta an si dih; maw Bawipa, pennak cu nangmah ta a si i nangmah cu zeizong vialte cungah cungnung bik na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rumnak siseh upatnak siseh nangmah sinin a rami an si i nangmah nih zeizong vialte kha na uk dih. Na kut chungah hin ṭhawnnak le thazang an um i na kut chungah hin mi vialte nganter khawhnak le thazang pek khawhnak a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cucaah kan Pathian, nangmah cu kan in lawmh i a sunglawimi na min cu kan thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Sihmanhsehlaw hi bantukin kannih nih lungtho tein kan in pekchanh khawh nakhnga caah hin keimah cu ahodah ka si i ka mi hna cu zeidah an si? Zeitintiah zeizong vialte cu nangmah sinin a rami an si i kan in pekmi hi nangmah ta lila a si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zeitintiah kannih cu, kan pupa vialte hna mipem an rak si bantuk khan, na hmaiah khual kan si; vawleicung i kan nunchung ni hna hi thladem bantuk men an si i ruahchannak zeihmanh a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, kan Pathian, na min thiang ca i inn pakhat saknak ah thil tampi kan damhmi vialte hna hi, nangmah kut chungin a chuakmi an si i nangmah ta an si dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka Pathian, nangmah nih lung kha na hneksak i dinnak kha na duhmi a si ti kha ka hngalh; ka lung dinnak in hi thil vialte hi lungtho tein kan pekchanh i atu cu hika i a ummi na mi hna nih lungthote le lunglawm tein an in pekchanh kha ka hmuh cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Maw Bawipa, kan pu Abraham, Isak le Israel i Pathian, hi bantuk thinlung le ruahnak hi na mi hna chungah hin chia zungzal law annih an lungthin cu nangmah leiah khan hruai ko hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka fapa Solomon nih hin lung ṭengnge lo tein na nawlbia hna le na hngalhternak bia hna le na phunglam hna kha a zulh hna i a tuah dih hna i ka timhlamh ciami biakinn hi a sak khawh nakhnga, nangmah nih amah cu bawm ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun David nih aa pummi vialte hna cu, “ Bawipa, nan Pathian cu thangṭhat ko u,” tiah a ti hna. Cun aa pummi vialte nih Bawipa, an pupa hna Pathian cu an thangṭhat i an lu an khun i Bawipa cu an biak i siangpahrang cu hmaizahnak an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Bawipa sinah khan raithawinak an tuah i, a thaituan ah cawtum thong khat le tuutum thong khat le tuufa thong khat cu, an thlet thawinak hna le an raithawinak hna he khan, Israel mi vialte caah duhdim tein i za in khangh thawinak ah Bawipa sinah cun an pekchanh hna;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />cun cu ni ah cun Bawipa hmaiah lunglawm ngaiin an ei i an ding. Cun David fapa Solomon cu siangpahrang ah a voi hnihnak an ser ṭhan i amah cu Bawipa ca i bawi ah chiti an thuh i Zadok cu tlangbawi caah chiti an thuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun Bawipa siangpahrang ṭhutdan ah cun Solomon cu a pa David can ah khan siangpahrang in a ṭhu i a hungcho i Israel mi vialte nih a bia kha an ngaih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Haotu vialte le miṭhawng hna le Siangpahrang David fapa hna zong nih khan Siangpahrang Solomon sinah zumhawktlak in kan um lai tiah bia an i kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun Bawipa nih Israel mi vialte hna mithmuh ah Solomon cu upatnak ngan a pek i amah hlanah Israel mi chung i siangpahrang ahohmanh a rak pek hna lomi siangpahrang sunparnak kha amah cu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuticun Jesse fapa David nih Israel mi vialte cu a pen hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel mi a pen hna chung cu kum sawm li a si; Hebron ah kum sarih a bawi i Jerusalem ah kum sawm thum le kum thum a bawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun upa ngaingai, tartlung nung in, rumnak le upatnak he a thi; cun Solomon a fapa cu amah hmun ah khan a hung bawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Siangpahrang David tuahsermi hna cu, a hmasa bik in a hmanung bik tiang, hmutu Samuel Chanrelnak ah le profet Nathan Chanrelnak ah le hmutu Gad Chanrelnak ah an i ṭial,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />a ukning kong le a ṭhawnnak le amah cung le Israel mi cung le ram dangdang hna cung i a tlungmi thil vialte hna kong zong kha an i tel ve.
  </para>
</usx>
